PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil ang paniwala ko po sa pangkasalukuyan sa industriya,

1116
02:02:47,200 --> 02:02:49,030
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% po ang may lisensya,

1117
02:02:54,035 --> 02:02:55,807
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% din po ang walang lisensya.

1118
02:02:55,807 --> 02:02:57,578
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, very positive naman, Your Honor, ang aming programa

1119
02:03:00,835 --> 02:03:03,440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sapagkat meron na po kaming mga natatanggap ng mga feelers

1120
02:03:05,790 --> 02:03:09,863
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para mag-surrender na ang ilang malalaking iligal na magpalisensya na po sa pangkasalukuyan.

1121
02:03:12,344 --> 02:03:13,272
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, number one po yun.

1122
02:03:15,669 --> 02:03:24,280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Number two, tulad nung binanggit ko kanina sa katanungan ni Congressman Odi earlier,

1123
02:03:29,069 --> 02:03:32,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: aming pong minomonitor ng husto ang income na or GGR or operations ngayon

1124
02:03:36,270 --> 02:03:38,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng mga online gaming companies sa pamamagitan ng isang third-party auditor.

1125
02:03:42,179 --> 02:03:50,030
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Doon po ay aming nakikita kung tunay pang nairimit nila or dinideklara nila yung tama nilang gross gaming revenue.

1126
02:03:52,861 --> 02:03:54,025
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At gusto ko pong ibalita sa inyo,

1127
02:03:57,502 --> 02:04:02,270
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: malaki na rin po ang naging pagtaas ng mga gross gaming revenue ng online gaming operators

1128
02:04:05,790 --> 02:04:11,440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: dahil naalaman nila at nakikita nilang nakatutok ang isang third-party auditor.

1129
02:04:16,199 --> 02:04:22,830
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At panghuli po ay nag-ikayat kami na sana'y marami pang mag-apply dito sa special class BPO

1130
02:04:26,730 --> 02:04:28,575
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung saan po yung mga nasa ibang bansa na mga malalaking operator ay gamitin na ang Pilipinas

1131
02:04:35,673 --> 02:04:41,030
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bilang kanilang mga backroom operations ay dito na gawin sa Maynila.

1132
02:04:44,887 --> 02:04:49,599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Very encouraging, Your Honor, Kong Ador, itong binabanggit ko sapagkat sa ngayon po eh,

1133
02:04:52,709 --> 02:04:55,062
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nasa sa nung linunsad po namin yung programa, two-fold po,

1134
02:04:55,062 --> 02:05:03,599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bukod sa may karagdagang kita sa PAGCOR, may himigit kumulang po sa 7,500 empleyado na

1135
02:05:07,567 --> 02:05:10,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang nasabing sektor nito na hindi nagbabayad ng minimum wage,

1136
02:05:13,790 --> 02:05:19,651
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kundi nagbabayad ng mga rates ng customer service agents ng mga BPO.

1137
02:05:19,651 --> 02:05:21,033
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So this amounts to an average of...

1138
02:05:23,969 --> 02:05:25,049
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 35,000 to 45,000 pesos a month.

1139
02:05:26,510 --> 02:05:29,234
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So yun po ang aming ginagawa sa pangkasulukuyan,

1140
02:05:29,538 --> 02:05:31,360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and we're also hoping, Your Honor, Kong Ador,

1141
02:05:34,111 --> 02:05:37,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na dumating yung pagkakataon na matapos na rin yung crisis sa Middle East,

1142
02:05:38,937 --> 02:05:41,990
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nang sa ganun eh, medyo pag nakaluwag-luwag naman sila eh,

1143
02:05:44,079 --> 02:05:46,109
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang tao eh, marami na rin ang magpe-patronize ng ating mga naroon.

1144
02:05:46,531 --> 02:05:50,840
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Chairman Al, for that response.

1145
02:05:57,348 --> 02:06:00,950
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Specifically, what is PAGCOR's strategy in terms of improving its regulatory framework,

1146
02:06:04,047 --> 02:06:07,507
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: expanding the legitimate gaming market, strengthening its digital monitoring and collection system,

1147
02:06:09,790 --> 02:06:11,679
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and addressing illegal and unlicensed operators,

1148
02:06:15,033 --> 02:06:19,690
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and also attracting responsible investment into the Philippine gaming industry.

1149
02:06:20,146 --> 02:06:23,500
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Okay.

1150
02:06:23,500 --> 02:06:24,736
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Doon po sa katanungan ninyo, Your Honor, una,

1151
02:06:28,440 --> 02:06:32,149
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa structure po, wala pong sawa kaming nagre-review ng aming structures and guidelines regularly

1152
02:06:38,185 --> 02:06:39,095
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para nang sa ganun ma-improve ito.

1153
02:06:43,467 --> 02:06:48,549
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yan po ay patutunayan ng updated structure ng online gaming rules ng PAGCOR.

1154
02:06:56,040 --> 02:06:59,549
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Halos po buwan-buwan, meron po kaming mga adjustments na ginagawa

1155
02:07:00,730 --> 02:07:06,910
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para ito po ay matama at maging ma-responsive sa pangkasulukuyang sitwasyon.

1156
02:07:11,530 --> 02:07:19,679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Number two, kami po ay patuloy na dumalabas at nagsasabi,

1157
02:07:20,990 --> 02:07:30,002
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nag-a-attend sa mga konbensyon, ngayon din naman ang mga exhibits abroad,

1158
02:07:30,002 --> 02:07:32,573
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at nagsasabing bukas ang Pilipinas sa paglilesensya ng land-based casinos,

1159
02:07:33,738 --> 02:07:37,830
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ngayon din naman ng ating online gaming.

1160
02:07:40,870 --> 02:07:45,061
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi man dapat sabihin, pero pwede na rin ipagmalaki na dito po sa Asia,

1161
02:07:45,213 --> 02:07:51,237
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay next to Macau.

1162
02:07:53,414 --> 02:07:55,051
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Halos we are competing.

1163
02:07:55,490 --> 02:07:56,975
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Head to head na with Singapore.

1164
02:07:56,975 --> 02:07:58,460
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And I believe, malaking bagay po itong darating na privatization,

1165
02:08:02,240 --> 02:08:04,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sapagkat pagdakailam na po at ang nagpatakbo na po ng mga kasino

1166
02:08:06,982 --> 02:08:09,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na sa pangkasulukuyan ay pinapatakbo ng PAGCOR,

1167
02:08:10,510 --> 02:08:13,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: naniniwala po ko it will be a game changer.

1168
02:08:15,760 --> 02:08:18,360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sapagkat pag ang pribadong sektor na ang nagpapatakbo ng negosyo,

1169
02:08:19,958 --> 02:08:21,410
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: iba na po ito eh.

1170
02:08:23,485 --> 02:08:28,950
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Eh sa pangkasulukuyan, your honor, we cannot compete head on with our licenses.

1171
02:08:32,229 --> 02:08:39,162
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung kasino Filipino, your honor, wala man lang kaming kwarto na mga hotel na inalok.

1172
02:08:39,432 --> 02:08:44,819
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Wala kaming mga restaurants, wala kaming mga mall, wala kaming mga prebileyong maipagkaloob.

1173
02:08:44,819 --> 02:08:47,792
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil wala namang yung mga properties natin.

1174
02:08:47,792 --> 02:08:50,300
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Na ganitong facilities.

1175
02:08:53,950 --> 02:09:00,819
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero pag ang kasino Filipino po at itong mga properties natin ay na-privatize na,

1176
02:09:00,819 --> 02:09:02,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: naniniwala po ako, yung bibili ng pribadong kumpanya,

1177
02:09:03,750 --> 02:09:06,770
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: eh magagawa na ng hakbang yan para lumakas ang kanilang kasino.

1178
02:09:09,672 --> 02:09:13,109
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At pag lumakas ang kasino, sapagkat tayo ay mga umalik tala lang ng license fees,

1179
02:09:15,663 --> 02:09:17,317
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: tatas din rin automatic ang income ng PAGCOR.

1180
02:09:19,549 --> 02:09:22,360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya yan po ang mga pangkasulukuyang mga ginagawa namin.

1181
02:09:26,950 --> 02:09:29,300
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At hopefully nga, pagka ito pong decoupling privatization ay maganap na,

1182
02:09:29,300 --> 02:09:33,430
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: malaki po ang magiging epekto nito sa kita ng PAGCOR.

1183
02:09:34,394 --> 02:09:36,910
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dagdag pa ron, Congressman Pleyto,

1184
02:09:41,397 --> 02:09:47,679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: eh masakit man sabihin, ang average po namin na pasweldo sa tao ay mahigit isang billion piso sa isang buwan.

1185
02:09:50,712 --> 02:09:55,119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tapos ang average na binabayad namin sa upa ng mga kasino properties namin,

1186
02:09:55,350 --> 02:09:57,599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: mahigit 250 million piso isang buwan.

1187
02:09:58,981 --> 02:10:02,149
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Eh yun lang po, maalis natin sa corporate expense ng PAGCOR,

1188
02:10:05,377 --> 02:10:06,797
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na parang naking bagay na po na ito para lang sa ganun,

1189
02:10:13,910 --> 02:10:15,940
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: maitulong yan ng PAGCOR sa nation building at sa ating kapwa mamamayang Pilipino.

1190
02:10:18,927 --> 02:10:20,125
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Maraming salamat, Chairman Al.

1191
02:10:21,813 --> 02:10:22,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Salamat po naman, Your Honor.

1192
02:10:23,011 --> 02:10:25,976
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At Madam Chair, pwede ba yung remaining time ko,

1193
02:10:25,976 --> 02:10:29,137
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: bigay ko sa aking kaibigan, kay Congressman Dumugan,

1194
02:10:29,963 --> 02:10:34,189
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: kasi napakarami namang nangyaring mga nasirang infrastruktura doon sa Koldilyera,

1195
02:10:37,912 --> 02:10:40,105
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: lalo ng Baguio-Binguet, sa infrastructure, saka agriculture.

1196
02:10:42,907 --> 02:10:46,679
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ito po, Mr. Chair, Madam Chair, I would like to place on record,

1197
02:10:48,589 --> 02:10:52,036
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: that despite the significant decline in its gross gaming revenues and net income,

1198
02:10:54,109 --> 02:10:56,280
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: PAGCOR has continued to fulfill its social responsibility.

1199
02:10:57,349 --> 02:10:58,567
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Gusto ko pa sa salamatan ng mga taga PAGCOR.

1200
02:11:01,030 --> 02:11:03,470
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: May sincere appreciation yung binanggit kanina ni Assistant President Balcos, si Eric,

1201
02:11:08,236 --> 02:11:11,392
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: tungkol po doon sa JBL, Children's Medical Center, in Clark, Pangpanga,

1202
02:11:13,189 --> 02:11:18,968
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: which was recently inaugurated by our beloved President Bongbong Marcos.

1203
02:11:19,154 --> 02:11:21,483
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ito po.

1204
02:11:21,483 --> 02:11:23,812
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ito po ay this very important investment for those children needing specialized medical care.

1205
02:11:24,250 --> 02:11:26,444
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Napakaganda po ito.

1206
02:11:26,444 --> 02:11:30,022
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Salamat kami mga taga Central Luzon, lalo na ang Bulacan, malapit doon,

1207
02:11:30,342 --> 02:11:32,047
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: at yung mga taga Central Luzon.

1208
02:11:32,367 --> 02:11:34,960
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Saka lahat po tayo, kasi para sa mga batang mga isakit,

1209
02:11:38,870 --> 02:11:41,159
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: napakaganda hindi na tayo pupunta ng Manila, doon na lang tayo sa Clark.

1210
02:11:44,310 --> 02:11:46,042
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: We've also seen PAGCOR.

1211
02:11:46,042 --> 02:11:47,062
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ito ay totoo po naman po ito.

1212
02:11:47,062 --> 02:11:50,103
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Yung mga pangangailangan sa Mindanao,

1213
02:11:50,103 --> 02:11:52,520
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: nung nangyari yung mga typhoons and earthquakes, recent earthquakes in Mindanao,

1214
02:11:52,533 --> 02:11:56,043
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: itong mga typhoons na nangyari dahil sa monsoon, south-west monsoon, itong habagat,

1215
02:11:59,924 --> 02:12:03,097
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: alam ko ang PAGCOR, they continue to affect many parts.

1216
02:12:06,809 --> 02:12:09,593
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: PAGCOR once again stands ready to provide assistance in our disaster-stricken communities.

1217
02:12:11,467 --> 02:12:15,027
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At the time, Madam Chair, when government resources are stretched

1218
02:12:16,990 --> 02:12:19,041
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: by the increasing free...

1219
02:12:19,041 --> 02:12:22,047
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: frequency and severity of natural disasters, this commitment is truly commendable.

1220
02:12:27,109 --> 02:12:31,936
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: It demonstrates that PAGCOR's role goes beyond gaming and revenue generation.

1221
02:12:31,936 --> 02:12:33,960
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: It is also an institution that contributes to nation building, ang sabi mo kanina, and

1222
02:12:36,719 --> 02:12:39,159
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: provides meaningful support when our people need it most, especially those who have lost

1223
02:12:41,639 --> 02:12:43,960
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: their homes, livelihoods, and sense of security because of the calamities.

1224
02:12:43,960 --> 02:12:44,760
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Madam Chair.

1225
02:12:44,760 --> 02:12:45,920
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Chairman Al.

1226
02:12:48,052 --> 02:12:50,212
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Representative Pleyto.

1227
02:12:50,212 --> 02:12:53,249
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Chair Al, would you like to respond?

1228
02:12:53,249 --> 02:12:55,021
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Okay po.

1229
02:12:55,190 --> 02:12:57,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Maraming salamat din po, Congressman Pleyto, sa inyong mga binanggit.

1230
02:13:02,986 --> 02:13:07,870
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Makakaasa po kayo na patuloy pong kasama ninyo ang PAGCOR sa pakikipagtulungan sa ating mga kababayan.

1231
02:13:09,095 --> 02:13:09,972
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Salamat po.

1232
02:13:09,972 --> 02:13:10,968
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Maraming salamat.

1233
02:13:11,491 --> 02:13:12,335
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Madam Chair.

1234
02:13:12,520 --> 02:13:13,760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Representative Pleyto.

1235
02:13:14,199 --> 02:13:16,599
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll now move to our next interpellator from the minority.

1236
02:13:18,400 --> 02:13:20,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Representative Iris Marie Montes.

1237
02:13:20,000 --> 02:13:25,159
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Chair. Magandang umaga po sa ating lahat.

1238
02:13:25,159 --> 02:13:36,480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Mr. Chair, Madam Chair, RA 11223 or the Universal Health Care Act was enacted on February 20, 2019.

1239
02:13:36,480 --> 02:13:53,960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Section 37B of that law provides that 50% of the 50% national government share from the income of PAGCOR will be used by PhilHealth for its benefit package.

1240
02:13:53,960 --> 02:14:06,119
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Also in the same law, it provided that remittance from PAGCOR should have started in 2020 or one year after the enactment of the law.

1241
02:14:06,119 --> 02:14:10,400
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: My first question is, was PAGCOR able to comply with this provision?

1242
02:14:10,400 --> 02:14:22,520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kailan po kayo nag-umpisang mag-remit sa National Treasury for UHC?

1243
02:14:22,520 --> 02:14:25,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Madam Chairperson, I'd like to answer.

1244
02:14:25,520 --> 02:14:40,212
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, from the implementation of the said Republic Act, PAGCOR has religiously remitted its shares to the national government.

1245
02:14:40,212 --> 02:14:51,597
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Now, as I had also clarified this in one of the hearings in the Senate, it is not the responsibility of PAGCOR to remit directly to PhilHealth.

1246
02:14:51,597 --> 02:14:52,159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes.

1247
02:14:52,159 --> 02:14:52,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Because the law states...

1248
02:14:52,920 --> 02:14:55,400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: states that we remit

1249
02:14:55,400 --> 02:14:56,719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and then it is the

1250
02:14:56,719 --> 02:14:59,280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: national government that will remit

1251
02:14:59,280 --> 02:15:00,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% of what

1252
02:15:00,920 --> 02:15:02,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: we attributed to

1253
02:15:02,920 --> 02:15:05,440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: the PhilHealth.

1254
02:15:05,440 --> 02:15:07,320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: In answer to your question,

1255
02:15:07,320 --> 02:15:10,719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, yes,

1256
02:15:10,719 --> 02:15:11,599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: PAGCOR has

1257
02:15:11,599 --> 02:15:13,599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: remitted religiously

1258
02:15:13,599 --> 02:15:15,320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and as of

1259
02:15:15,320 --> 02:15:17,599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: today, we are current

1260
02:15:17,599 --> 02:15:18,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and wala po kaming

1261
02:15:18,880 --> 02:15:20,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: pagkukulang noong sa nasabing

1262
02:15:20,960 --> 02:15:22,360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: remittance na iyo.

1263
02:15:22,360 --> 02:15:24,719
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po. So, religiously

1264
02:15:24,719 --> 02:15:26,880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: meaning compliant with the

1265
02:15:26,880 --> 02:15:28,440
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: provision of the law one year after its

1266
02:15:28,440 --> 02:15:30,760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: enactment. So, I suppose it's 2020

1267
02:15:30,760 --> 02:15:33,079
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ano po. Based kasi po

1268
02:15:33,079 --> 02:15:34,719
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: dito sa inyong presentation

1269
02:15:34,719 --> 02:15:36,920
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: handout, tinignan nyo

1270
02:15:36,920 --> 02:15:38,559
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: lang po ang present lang

1271
