2787
03:04:48,625 --> 03:04:50,637
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay. Thank you, Madam Chair.

2788
03:04:50,637 --> 03:04:55,932
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And again, I would like to reiterate my point that I raised a clarificatory question ago

2789
03:04:55,932 --> 03:05:01,920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: about the budget, no, that being taken away from PAGCOR

2790
03:05:01,920 --> 03:05:07,096
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: vis-a-vis to Philippine Sports Commission na dapat ibalik sa inyo.

2791
03:05:07,096 --> 03:05:09,877
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi ang dami nyo natutulungan, sa totoo lang.

2792
03:05:09,877 --> 03:05:10,810
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, thank you.

2793
03:05:10,810 --> 03:05:13,388
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam Chair, thank you, PAGCOR family.

2794
03:05:13,388 --> 03:05:14,606
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Salamat din po, Your Honor.

2795
03:05:14,606 --> 03:05:17,102
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Chairman Tengco.

2796
03:05:17,102 --> 03:05:20,310
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much, Representative Presley De Jesus.

2797
03:05:26,600 --> 03:05:29,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll now move to our next interpellator from the majority.

2798
03:05:29,120 --> 03:05:33,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We have two, but they don't seem to be here in the room.

2799
03:05:33,680 --> 03:05:36,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Representative Brian Poe.

2800
03:05:36,120 --> 03:05:39,200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ah, okay. Sorry, Brian. I didn't see you.

2801
03:05:39,319 --> 03:05:40,560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nakabalik na pala.

2802
03:05:41,160 --> 03:05:44,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Next, from the minority, Representative Brian Poe.

2803
03:05:46,560 --> 03:05:47,080
Rep. Brian Poe: Thank you, Madam Chair.

2804
03:05:47,080 --> 03:05:50,600
Rep. Brian Poe: My apologies. Majority. From the majority, Representative Brian Poe.

2805
03:05:50,600 --> 03:05:52,239
Rep. Brian Poe: Thank you.

2806
03:05:52,239 --> 03:05:57,760
Rep. Brian Poe: So, first and foremost, Madam Chair, I just want to thank the PAGCOR chairman

2807
03:05:57,760 --> 03:06:00,840
Rep. Brian Poe: because immediately after our previous hearing,

2808
03:06:00,840 --> 03:06:07,560
Rep. Brian Poe: 44 out of the 52 illegal websites that we mentioned were immediately taken down.

2809
03:06:07,560 --> 03:06:14,200
Rep. Brian Poe: However, Madam Chair, I'd like to bring up that some of these sites are now accessible again.

2810
03:06:14,200 --> 03:06:15,000
Rep. Brian Poe: So, I have a list.

2811
03:06:15,000 --> 03:06:21,040
Rep. Brian Poe: I have a list here of the websites which you can still access via the computer.

2812
03:06:21,040 --> 03:06:24,160
Rep. Brian Poe: My team is pulling it up on the laptop so that we can show it to them.

2813
03:06:24,160 --> 03:06:32,200
Rep. Brian Poe: But to save time, we will submit it to the committee just so that PAGCOR can also follow up on this.

2814
03:06:32,200 --> 03:06:39,200
Rep. Brian Poe: Aside from that, I also want to point out that PAGCOR, if I'm not mistaken,

2815
03:06:39,200 --> 03:06:45,319
Rep. Brian Poe: your GRR or Gross Gaming Revenues in 2025,

2816
03:06:45,319 --> 03:06:54,359
Rep. Brian Poe: is up 6.39% from $372 billion in 2024.

2817
03:06:54,359 --> 03:06:59,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, how much are we looking at in terms of GGR for 2025 again?

2818
03:06:59,359 --> 03:07:00,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I think it was mentioned earlier.

2819
03:07:00,960 --> 03:07:06,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Are you, Your Honor, are you referring to 2025 or 2026?

2820
03:07:06,120 --> 03:07:08,200
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: For 2026.

2821
03:07:08,200 --> 03:07:15,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: For 2026, there is already a decline for both land-based casinos and online gaming.

2822
03:07:15,760 --> 03:07:22,517
Rep. Brian Poe: We are looking at about P370 billion pesos.

2823
03:07:22,517 --> 03:07:24,800
Rep. Brian Poe: P370 billion pesos.

2824
03:07:24,800 --> 03:07:26,760
Rep. Brian Poe: More or less?

2825
03:07:26,760 --> 03:07:27,520
Rep. Brian Poe: Sige po.

2826
03:07:27,520 --> 03:07:32,040
Rep. Brian Poe: If we're looking at P370 billion pesos,

2827
03:07:32,040 --> 03:07:42,600
Rep. Brian Poe: we're looking at how much in terms of the annual wagering turnover for 2026.

2828
03:07:42,600 --> 03:07:45,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, kumbaga, the gross revenue po that we,

2829
03:07:45,640 --> 03:07:49,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: are able to get is, yes, sir.

2830
03:07:49,720 --> 03:07:56,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: As, Your Honor, as gross gaming revenue is defined by total bets, less payouts.

2831
03:07:56,520 --> 03:08:12,520
Rep. Brian Poe: So, maybe I should say the total wages placed will be in the vicinity of about P3 trillion.

2832
03:08:12,520 --> 03:08:15,399
Rep. Brian Poe: About P3 trillion pesos, no?

2833
03:08:15,399 --> 03:08:15,840
Rep. Brian Poe: Okay.

2834
03:08:15,840 --> 03:08:18,840
Rep. Brian Poe: The reason why I bring this up, Madam Chair,

2835
03:08:18,840 --> 03:08:25,680
Rep. Brian Poe: is because if there's about P3 trillion pesos that are being wagered per annum,

2836
03:08:25,680 --> 03:08:31,600
Rep. Brian Poe: and we're getting about P300 plus billion in gross revenue from this,

2837
03:08:31,600 --> 03:08:35,800
Rep. Brian Poe: can you imagine how much of the undeclared revenue

2838
03:08:35,800 --> 03:08:41,560
Rep. Brian Poe: or how much of the undeclared annual wagers we're missing out on in terms of government revenue,

2839
03:08:41,560 --> 03:08:45,160
Rep. Brian Poe: which could go towards government projects, government services?

2840
03:08:45,160 --> 03:08:48,840
Rep. Brian Poe: And if we look here, for example,

2841
03:08:48,840 --> 03:08:54,560
Rep. Brian Poe: I just pulled up PopoLive, which is accessible online again.

2842
03:08:54,560 --> 03:08:58,000
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, may I ask if PopoLive and these other apps,

2843
03:08:58,000 --> 03:09:06,760
Rep. Brian Poe: sorry, these other apps and websites from last year were able to secure a gambling license from PAGCOR?

2844
03:09:06,760 --> 03:09:13,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, I believe we have not issued a license,

2845
03:09:13,080 --> 03:09:20,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: primarily because we have, since last two years,

2846
03:09:20,560 --> 03:09:24,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: had a moratorium on licenses.

2847
03:09:24,680 --> 03:09:34,567
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, I am 100% sure they remain to be part of the illegal operators operating in the Philippines.

2848
03:09:34,567 --> 03:09:35,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Madam Chair, so...

2849
03:09:35,439 --> 03:09:40,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, if you don't mind, I just want to say that

2850
03:09:40,319 --> 03:09:44,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I'd like to thank you for recognizing the fact that

2851
03:09:44,600 --> 03:09:48,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: when you brought out the name,

2852
03:09:48,600 --> 03:09:53,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: the names of the illegal operators last year,

2853
03:09:53,800 --> 03:09:56,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: they were pulled down or put up.

2854
03:09:56,439 --> 03:09:59,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: That was not because of us.

2855
03:09:59,439 --> 03:10:09,639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We did make the recommendation to the DICT, CICC, and the NTC.

2856
03:10:09,639 --> 03:10:15,917
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Because they are, Your Honor, the ones with the police powers.

2857
03:10:15,917 --> 03:10:17,987
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: They are the ones who have the power.

2858
03:10:17,987 --> 03:10:19,350
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We are not...

2859
03:10:19,350 --> 03:10:21,090
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: There is nothing to be done but to make a recommendation,

2860
03:10:21,090 --> 03:10:23,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: to make a recommendation, and to make a recommendation only.

2861
03:10:23,080 --> 03:10:27,587
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, I just want to give credit where credit is due.

2862
03:10:27,587 --> 03:10:31,572
Rep. Brian Poe: Because we are the ones who just recommended and just said

2863
03:10:31,572 --> 03:10:38,560
Rep. Brian Poe: here in these government agencies that these are illegal and their operations must continue.

2864
03:10:38,560 --> 03:10:45,399
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, I'd like to thank the PAGCOR chairman for clarifying that until now,

2865
03:10:45,399 --> 03:10:48,279
Rep. Brian Poe: these apps and these gaming sites do not have a license.

2866
03:10:48,279 --> 03:10:55,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Madam Chair, may I ask kung kasama po sa GGR ang revenue galing sa mga apps

2867
03:10:55,760 --> 03:11:01,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: or yung mga wagers placed on any of these websites or apps?

2868
03:11:01,520 --> 03:11:02,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, hindi po kasama.

2869
03:11:02,920 --> 03:11:12,040
Rep. Brian Poe: We only track the GGR of our legal operators or our PAGCOR licenses.

2870
03:11:12,040 --> 03:11:16,200
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, I bring this up kasi kung tutuusin itong mga sites na ito,

2871
03:11:16,200 --> 03:11:18,200
Rep. Brian Poe: hindi sila kasama sa GGR,

2872
03:11:18,200 --> 03:11:21,239
Rep. Brian Poe: yung GGR natin is already in the billions.

2873
03:11:21,239 --> 03:11:26,840
Rep. Brian Poe: The total annual wager tracked is estimated at around 3 trillion pesos.

2874
03:11:26,840 --> 03:11:32,399
Rep. Brian Poe: What more if these apps, these websites were properly tracked or suspended?

2875
03:11:32,399 --> 03:11:36,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kasi kung suspended po sila, then they will only gamble through the legal websites.

2876
03:11:36,920 --> 03:11:38,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tama po ba?

2877
03:11:38,359 --> 03:11:41,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, Mr. Chair, Madam Chair...

2878
03:11:41,600 --> 03:11:43,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, you are right, Your Honor.

2879
03:11:43,399 --> 03:11:46,200
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yun po ang sinasabi ko kanina,

2880
03:11:46,200 --> 03:11:51,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na 50% lang po ng industriya ang may lisensya,

2881
03:11:51,560 --> 03:11:54,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% po ay walang lisensya.

2882
03:11:54,279 --> 03:11:59,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: You can just imagine, Your Honor, Congressman po,

2883
03:11:59,120 --> 03:12:03,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: what government is losing in terms of potential revenue.

2884
03:12:03,800 --> 03:12:10,560
Rep. Brian Poe: Kaya talagang, dapat talagang pagtulungan na ating masugpo itong mga illegal na ito.

2885
03:12:10,560 --> 03:12:15,840
Rep. Brian Poe: Malaki po, nawawala sa atin lahat dyan sa nangyayaring yan, Your Honor.

2886
03:12:15,840 --> 03:12:18,800
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, what's important here is during this committee hearing,

2887
03:12:18,800 --> 03:12:26,960
Rep. Brian Poe: nabanggit po ni Chairman that wala pang na-issue na bago na lisensya because there's a moratorium.

2888
03:12:26,960 --> 03:12:30,399
Rep. Brian Poe: 50% lang ang nakukuha natin na revenue.

2889
03:12:30,399 --> 03:12:36,680
Rep. Brian Poe: Instead, we could be doubling the government revenue that we could possibly get from this to put into programs.

2890
03:12:36,680 --> 03:12:40,960
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, moving on quickly to my next set of questions.

2891
03:12:40,960 --> 03:12:43,439
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, PAGCOR pointed out that there are many,

2892
03:12:43,439 --> 03:12:45,840
Rep. Brian Poe: there are many nation building programs.

2893
03:12:45,840 --> 03:12:49,000
Rep. Brian Poe: Kumbaga, they have the school building program,

2894
03:12:49,000 --> 03:12:53,040
Rep. Brian Poe: they have the patient transport vehicles which they have donated,

2895
03:12:53,040 --> 03:12:55,479
Rep. Brian Poe: relief ops that they have conducted,

2896
03:12:55,479 --> 03:13:00,800
Rep. Brian Poe: and other, a medical center even that they've inaugurated.

2897
03:13:00,800 --> 03:13:12,279
Rep. Brian Poe: Pero gusto kong magtanong kung meron po silang donations or funding po para sa mental health services para sa mga gambling addicts po.

2898
03:13:12,279 --> 03:13:19,720
Rep. Brian Poe: Kasi kung tutuusin itong mga working class citizens po natin na nagiging biktima po ng online gaming

2899
03:13:19,720 --> 03:13:21,720
Rep. Brian Poe: and naging addict po,

2900
03:13:21,720 --> 03:13:28,960
Rep. Brian Poe: naghahanap ng solusyon ng paraan para iwasan itong gambling habit nila.

2901
03:13:28,960 --> 03:13:37,359
Rep. Brian Poe: And I was hoping that PAGCOR might have some mental health programs that they are funding or that they are supporting

2902
03:13:37,359 --> 03:13:40,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: so that it could be free for our constituents

2903
03:13:40,080 --> 03:13:43,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: who can't afford mental health services.

2904
03:13:43,479 --> 03:13:46,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron po ba, Mr. Chair?

2905
03:13:46,600 --> 03:13:49,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, Congressman po.

2906
03:13:49,640 --> 03:13:55,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: That is part of our responsible gaming programs.

2907
03:13:55,040 --> 03:13:59,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: As I had mentioned, we have our partner, Seagulls Flock Foundation.

2908
03:13:59,319 --> 03:14:09,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And sila po ay, sila ang nagpapatakbo ng 24-7 call center na sumasagot sa mga may problema

2909
03:14:09,359 --> 03:14:11,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa paglalaro.

2910
03:14:11,040 --> 03:14:19,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At tulad ng ipinangako ko kanina, magsusumiti po kami ng report sa committee nito

2911
03:14:19,520 --> 03:14:29,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para mapakita kung ilan na po yung ating mga natulungan tungkol sa mga himihingi ng tulong dahil sila ay,

2912
03:14:29,960 --> 03:14:33,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: meron na, nalululunan sila sa pagsusugal.

2913
03:14:33,600 --> 03:14:38,279
Rep. Brian Poe: We will do that and we will submit to the committee.

2914
03:14:38,279 --> 03:14:44,800
Rep. Brian Poe: So that it can be disseminated to all our, to the members of the committee.

2915
03:14:44,800 --> 03:14:49,479
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, I'd like to request for a copy of those programs, the number of people.

2916
03:14:49,479 --> 03:14:53,439
Rep. Brian Poe: the number of people who have been helped, how much funding has gone into it,

2917
03:14:53,439 --> 03:14:55,920
Rep. Brian Poe: kasi importante at mahalaga po ito.

2918
03:14:55,920 --> 03:14:58,880
Rep. Brian Poe: Tulad ng sinabi ni Rep. Elie earlier,

2919
03:14:58,880 --> 03:15:04,560
Rep. Brian Poe: we do have a gambling addiction problem here in this country that we want to address.

2920
03:15:04,560 --> 03:15:07,600
Rep. Brian Poe: We want it to be responsible, we want it to be well-managed,

2921
03:15:07,600 --> 03:15:13,479
Rep. Brian Poe: but we also want people to have options para kung gusto nila tigilin tong habit na to,

2922
03:15:13,479 --> 03:15:18,080
Rep. Brian Poe: pwede naman sila mag-seek ng help galing sa gobyerno po.

2923
03:15:18,080 --> 03:15:21,880
Rep. Brian Poe: So, further, I just want to ask also, Madam Chair,

2924
03:15:21,880 --> 03:15:27,600
Rep. Brian Poe: if PAGCOR, given all of its efforts with law enforcement,

2925
03:15:27,600 --> 03:15:33,439
Rep. Brian Poe: is only able to address 50% of the gambling that takes place in this country,

2926
03:15:33,439 --> 03:15:41,960
Rep. Brian Poe: what programs or what, I guess, facilities in CICC, DICT,

2927
03:15:41,960 --> 03:15:45,248
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: can we add funding to or can we strengthen

2928
03:15:45,248 --> 03:15:46,160
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: in order to...

2929
03:15:46,160 --> 03:15:52,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: in order for us to address all this illegal online gaming?

2930
03:15:52,720 --> 03:15:58,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, in our discussions since last year with DICT,

2931
03:15:58,520 --> 03:16:01,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: headed by Secretary Henry Aguda,

2932
03:16:01,000 --> 03:16:07,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and CICC, headed by ASEC Aboy Paraíso,

2933
03:16:07,720 --> 03:16:13,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: there are certain tools that they need to procure.

2934
03:16:13,040 --> 03:16:15,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: In fact,

2935
03:16:15,399 --> 03:16:17,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: it has already been identified

2936
03:16:17,800 --> 03:16:21,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang nagiging problema po kasi,

2937
03:16:21,439 --> 03:16:23,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, Congressman po,

2938
03:16:23,279 --> 03:16:26,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: talagang because of the advances of technology,

2939
03:16:26,720 --> 03:16:30,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: talagang lahat makina na eh.

2940
03:16:30,040 --> 03:16:35,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, I think they're in the process now of procuring

2941
03:16:35,080 --> 03:16:39,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: or about to procure equipment that can track

2942
03:16:39,640 --> 03:16:45,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: those that are using VPNs to shadow their presence.

2943
03:16:45,800 --> 03:16:47,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And,

2944
03:16:47,199 --> 03:16:53,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I think that is what they will be lobbying for sa Kongreso.

2945
03:16:53,279 --> 03:16:56,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, as I mentioned earlier,

2946
03:16:56,000 --> 03:17:01,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: hindi ko po maaaring pakialaman yung kanilang teritoryo.

2947
03:17:01,399 --> 03:17:04,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kami po ay rekomendatory sa kanila.

2948
03:17:04,239 --> 03:17:06,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And, I can say one thing.

2949
03:17:06,680 --> 03:17:11,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: The last year, our collaboration with DICT,

2950
03:17:11,239 --> 03:17:15,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: between DICT, CICC, NTC and PAGCOR,

2951
03:17:15,960 --> 03:17:16,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: has

2952
03:17:16,760 --> 03:17:26,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: really been so good na we continue to close so many illegal sites.

2953
03:17:26,199 --> 03:17:28,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Unfortunately, kung anong bilis ng pagsasara,

2954
03:17:28,720 --> 03:17:36,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ganon din bilis ang pagbubukas nila muli because of so many things that they can do.

2955
03:17:36,399 --> 03:17:41,960
Rep. Brian Poe: So, that's it. That's my answer to your question, Your Honor, Kong.

2956
03:17:41,960 --> 03:17:46,160
Rep. Brian Poe: Thank you. Madam Chair, if I may, just a quick anecdote about that.

2957
03:17:46,160 --> 03:17:55,439
Rep. Brian Poe: I want to note the efforts of the NBI, CICC, and PAGCOR because I've actually joined them po sa mga raids nila.

2958
03:17:55,439 --> 03:17:58,080
Rep. Brian Poe: And I see the effort that they're putting into it.

2959
03:17:58,080 --> 03:18:03,520
Rep. Brian Poe: But the reason why I bring up this question is because could we have a list from PAGCOR

2960
03:18:03,520 --> 03:18:10,880
Rep. Brian Poe: kung ano yung mga equipment na kailangan i-procure ng CICC at ibang law enforcement at magkano po?

2961
03:18:10,880 --> 03:18:15,826
Rep. Brian Poe: Kasi I want to see how much it will cost versus how much revenue we would be able to,

2962
03:18:15,826 --> 03:18:18,880
Rep. Brian Poe: how much revenue we would be able to generate from properly monitoring.

2963
03:18:18,880 --> 03:18:23,479
Rep. Brian Poe: Kung meron po tayong projection na kung meron tayong ganitong klaseng equipment,

2964
03:18:23,479 --> 03:18:30,239
Rep. Brian Poe: we will be able to increase the number of websites that we're able to monitor and take down, etc.,

2965
03:18:30,239 --> 03:18:38,560
Rep. Brian Poe: how much we would be able to generate in revenue if we have proper policing through these machineries and technologies.

2966
03:18:38,560 --> 03:18:42,520
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, if we make this investment in proper policing,

2967
03:18:42,520 --> 03:18:45,920
Rep. Brian Poe: maybe we could increase government revenue in the succeeding year.

2968
03:18:45,920 --> 03:18:47,640
Rep. Brian Poe: At least that's the way I see it.

2969
03:18:47,640 --> 03:18:50,600
Rep. Brian Poe: Yun lang po. And thank you for the time, Madam Chair.

2970
03:18:50,600 --> 03:18:52,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Vice Chair Bryan po.

2971
03:18:52,080 --> 03:18:57,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Actually, I think it's fitting because Vice Chair Bryan po is anyways defending the budget of the DICT.

2972
03:18:57,520 --> 03:19:04,399
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So you can also pose that same question to the CICC when we deliberate on the budget of DICT.

2973
03:19:04,399 --> 03:19:06,880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But very good point.

2974
03:19:06,880 --> 03:19:12,359
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sigur po, we'll just wait, Kong Bryan, so we can also share with PAGCOR the websites,

2975
03:19:12,359 --> 03:19:15,560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the screenshot of the websites that you've pointed out earlier.

2976
03:19:15,560 --> 03:19:21,439
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But it's really a matter of enforcement and reinforcement given, as Chair Al was saying,

2977
03:19:21,439 --> 03:19:25,399
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as soon as those sites are taken down after a while, they go back up again.

2978
03:19:25,399 --> 03:19:29,439
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So we'll bring it up.

2979
03:19:29,439 --> 03:19:33,439
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ikaw naman magpapreside ng DICT budget hearing.

2980
03:19:33,439 --> 03:19:37,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So you can also bring it up with CICC when the time comes.

2981
03:19:37,160 --> 03:19:39,319
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you. Thank you, Chair Al.

2982
03:19:39,319 --> 03:19:42,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much, Vice Chair Bryan po.

2983
03:19:42,160 --> 03:19:45,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll now move to the next interpellator.

2984
03:19:45,000 --> 03:19:49,399
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: From the minority, Representative Robert Nazal.

2985
03:19:49,399 --> 03:19:51,399
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Madam Chair.

2986
03:19:51,399 --> 03:19:54,760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Good morning.

2987
03:19:54,760 --> 03:20:00,120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Good afternoon, Chairman Tengco.

2988
03:20:00,120 --> 03:20:06,520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Allow me first to commend PAGCOR and PAGCOR family for its commendable initiatives,

2989
03:20:06,520 --> 03:20:13,800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: particularly the nationwide school building program and the donation of patient transport vehicles.

2990
03:20:13,800 --> 03:20:20,319
Rep. Roberto Nazal: These efforts have brought real benefit to many of our communities and we are grateful for that.

2991
03:20:20,319 --> 03:20:25,160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: If I may, however, raise a small concern.

2992
03:20:25,160 --> 03:20:34,560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mayroon po ako kasing pending request na more than one year na ang anniversary

2993
03:20:34,560 --> 03:20:39,520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ng mga wheelchairs and mga ambulances para sa mga constituent natin.

2994
03:20:39,520 --> 03:20:42,680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I mentioned this not as a complaint, no?

2995
03:20:42,680 --> 03:20:52,160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But simply to ask in the spirit of transparency, may pagkakaiba po ba ang minority ang nag-request?

2996
03:20:52,160 --> 03:20:56,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, wala pong pagkakaiba.

2997
03:20:56,640 --> 03:21:02,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang totoo po dun sa PTV, kami po nag-augment lang talaga sa PCSO.

2998
03:21:02,960 --> 03:21:05,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At hindi naman talaga naming gawa ay magbigay.

2999
03:21:05,800 --> 03:21:10,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tumulong po kami. Nagpasobra na ng konti.

3000
03:21:10,760 --> 03:21:14,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, yung pong request niyo eh, titinan ko kaagad pagkatapos nito

3001
03:21:14,319 --> 03:21:20,479
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ng mapatunayan sa inyong wala pong pagkakaiba ang minority at majority

3002
03:21:20,479 --> 03:21:22,399
Committee/agency brief acknowledgment: pag ang PAGCOR po ang timitiin dito.

3003
03:21:22,399 --> 03:21:25,880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, thank you, Mr. Chair. Salamat po diyan.

3004
03:21:25,880 --> 03:21:34,080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, I will go directly to my questions.

3005
03:21:34,080 --> 03:21:41,160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair, I would like to clarify the effect of the planned privatization of Casino Filipino

3006
03:21:41,160 --> 03:21:44,479
Rep. Roberto Nazal: on universal healthcare funding.

3007
03:21:44,479 --> 03:21:52,520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: In Section 37 of the UHC Act, 50% of the national government share from PAGCOR income

3008
03:21:52,520 --> 03:21:56,840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: is earmarked for PhilHealth.

3009
03:21:56,840 --> 03:22:04,960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Once PAGCOR disposes of its Casino Filipino operations and becomes purely a regulatory body,

3010
03:22:04,960 --> 03:22:08,439
Rep. Roberto Nazal: what happens to the UHC earmark?

3011
03:22:08,439 --> 03:22:14,520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Will the national government share, and therefore yung 50% going to PhilHealth,

3012
03:22:14,520 --> 03:22:19,720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: due to be computed from PAGCOR's entire gaming-related income,

3013
03:22:19,720 --> 03:22:28,040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: including regulatory fees and license fee shares from private casinos, e-games, and other licenses?

3014
03:22:28,040 --> 03:22:34,199
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Or will the legal revenue base covered by the UHC earmark become smaller

3015
03:22:34,199 --> 03:22:41,279
Rep. Roberto Nazal: once PAGCOR is no longer itself a gaming operator?

3016
03:22:41,279 --> 03:22:44,520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Na compute na po ba ng PAGCOR with the deal,

3017
03:22:44,520 --> 03:22:48,760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: together with the DOF, DBM, and PhilHealth,

3018
03:22:48,760 --> 03:22:54,399
Rep. Roberto Nazal: na quantify na po ba natin yung UHC contribution before and after privatization?

3019
03:22:54,399 --> 03:23:02,359
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And if so, can you please give the committee the projected PAGCOR contribution to UHC

3020
03:23:02,359 --> 03:23:12,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: for 2026, 2027, and 2028, and the first full year after privatization?

3021
03:23:12,120 --> 03:23:14,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Thank you for the answer.

3022
03:23:14,319 --> 03:23:17,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: The question, Your Honor.

3023
03:23:17,840 --> 03:23:21,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, na compute na po, at ang totoo po eh,

3024
03:23:21,800 --> 03:23:24,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung meron pong nag-aaral niya ng lubos ngayon,

3025
03:23:24,520 --> 03:23:30,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: eh yung pong GCG, Governance Commission for GOCCs.

3026
03:23:30,479 --> 03:23:35,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil, Your Honor, Congressman Nazal,

3027
03:23:35,960 --> 03:23:42,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang magre-rekomenda po sa tanggapan ng Pangulo ay ang GCG.

3028
03:23:42,080 --> 03:23:42,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah.

3029
03:23:42,880 --> 03:23:47,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sila po ang magre-rekomenda kung dapat ma-ituloy

3030
03:23:47,520 --> 03:23:51,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: or dapat matuloy ang decoupling privatization.

3031
03:23:51,439 --> 03:23:57,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, nakita na po namin yan, pinag-aaralan po,

3032
03:23:57,880 --> 03:24:03,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: miyembro po din ng GCG Commission, ang PAGCOR,

3033
03:24:03,080 --> 03:24:11,160
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ah, ang Secretary of Finance, gayon din po ang Secretary of Budget and Management, DBM.

3034
03:24:11,160 --> 03:24:13,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sila po eh ex-officio members ito.

3035
03:24:13,560 --> 03:24:19,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, maliwanag po na pinag-aaralan po at nakita na po yan.

3036
03:24:19,439 --> 03:24:27,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa aming pong internal na pag-aaral, nakita po namin na hindi po in the long run,

3037
03:24:27,920 --> 03:24:33,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: in the medium term, ah, hindi lang po magpapantay, mahigitan pa.

3038
03:24:33,479 --> 03:24:38,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Because of the operational efficiency po na mangyayari.

3039
03:24:38,239 --> 03:24:39,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah.

3040
03:24:39,319 --> 03:24:39,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah.

3041
03:24:39,600 --> 03:24:44,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, sa ngayon po kasi, binanggit ko nga kanina eh,

3042
03:24:44,000 --> 03:24:51,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: napangakin na po ng drug ng karga ng ah, salaries and wages ng empleyado.

3043
03:24:51,120 --> 03:25:01,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Gayon din naman po ng halimbawa ay yung ating ah, rentals sa different properties natin.

3044
03:25:01,720 --> 03:25:07,276
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah, himigit ko mo lang po, one and a half billion pesos a month ang nagagastos natin dito.

3045
03:25:07,276 --> 03:25:08,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah.

3046
03:25:08,120 --> 03:25:12,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, kapag nawala po lahat yan, eh, tataas po yung income ng PAGCOR.

3047
03:25:12,880 --> 03:25:19,359
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And sa huli naman po, may contribution kami na minimum of 50% of our net profit.

3048
03:25:19,359 --> 03:25:25,479
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, that will neutralize in the long run yung pong adjustments na mangyayari.

3049
03:25:25,479 --> 03:25:28,990
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Magkano po ba yung expected revenues natin once ma-privatize?

3050
03:25:28,990 --> 03:25:30,080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ah.

3051
03:25:30,080 --> 03:25:36,120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And how much are you projecting will be the share on the first year or the first and second year alone?

3052
03:25:36,120 --> 03:25:37,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Opo.

3053
03:25:37,199 --> 03:25:43,160
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Wala po kasi, ah, Your Honor, ah, wala po kasi kaming control.

3054
03:25:43,160 --> 03:25:49,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Basta yung amin lang is we remit our share to the national government.

3055
03:25:49,600 --> 03:25:59,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And it is the national government that supposedly remits to the PhilHealth or to the Universal Healthcare Fund.

3056
03:25:59,399 --> 03:26:04,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang liniliwanag ko po kanina pa, we have been updated.

3057
03:26:04,000 --> 03:26:06,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Updated po tayo sa remittance.

3058
03:26:06,960 --> 03:26:11,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, nasa sa national treasury na po yung pagbibigay.

3059
03:26:11,520 --> 03:26:19,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kasi meron pong kumisang hindi pagkakaintindihan na kami po ang nagre-remit sa Universal Healthcare Fund.

3060
03:26:19,199 --> 03:26:30,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang nangyayari po, on a monthly basis, kami po ay nagbibigay sa national treasury.

3061
03:26:30,800 --> 03:26:40,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At pagkatapos, obligasyon na rin po at responsibilidad nila ang mag-remit sa Universal Healthcare Fund.

3062
03:26:40,080 --> 03:26:47,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, sa ngayon po, I just want to clarify this, just like I, how I answered earlier, I think you were not present.

3063
03:26:47,960 --> 03:26:54,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Wala po kaming control dun sa remittance to the, because ang batas po maliwanag.

3064
03:26:54,800 --> 03:27:06,960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Remit your share to the national government and the national government will remit 50% of what you have remitted to the Universal Healthcare Fund.

3065
03:27:06,960 --> 03:27:15,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, what you're saying, Mr. Chair, Madam Chair, is that you have no figures on how much is being remitted to PhilHealth?

3066
03:27:15,880 --> 03:27:19,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Well, we, it's not that we do not have figures, we do not have control.

3067
03:27:19,359 --> 03:27:31,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But, I'll just give you an example, for year 2025, for example, we remitted more or less 50 billion pesos to the national treasury.

3068
03:27:31,279 --> 03:27:34,190
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That means, following the intent of the law.

3069
03:27:34,190 --> 03:27:34,920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Dapat.

3070
03:27:34,920 --> 03:27:38,570
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 25 billion.

3071
03:27:38,570 --> 03:27:42,319
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes.

3072
03:27:42,319 --> 03:27:50,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But, the reason you're saying this, Madam Chair, is because, meron po bang naging deviation from the, what you remitted to the national treasury?

3073
03:27:50,720 --> 03:27:53,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Wala ah, hindi na po namin alam yun eh.

3074
03:27:53,080 --> 03:27:57,460
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sapagkat sabi ko nga, buwanan po, we remit to the national treasury.

3075
03:27:57,460 --> 03:27:58,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yeah.

3076
03:27:58,600 --> 03:28:06,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And, the law states, the national treasury or the national government should remit,

3077
03:28:06,840 --> 03:28:12,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: should remit 50% of what we have remitted to the Universal Healthcare Fund.

3078
03:28:12,199 --> 03:28:16,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Now, whether they're remitting or not is beyond our control already.

3079
03:28:16,600 --> 03:28:20,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: That is what I'm trying to point out, Your Honor.

3080
03:28:20,560 --> 03:28:22,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah, and that was asked earlier also.

3081
03:28:22,800 --> 03:28:29,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, kasi may akala po sila na diretsyo po kaming nagre-remit sa Universal Healthcare Fund.

3082
03:28:29,920 --> 03:28:31,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi po ganon.

3083
03:28:31,120 --> 03:28:32,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang batas po ay maliwanag.

3084
03:28:32,960 --> 03:28:48,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Remit 50% of your revenue to the national government and the government under the Universal Healthcare Act must remit 50% of what we have remitted to the Universal Healthcare Fund.

3085
03:28:48,840 --> 03:29:02,680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Considering the privatization, ah, Madam Chair, meron po bang, meron po ba kayo nakikita na dapat baguhin ng Congress in terms of legislation para, ah, mag-guarantee na ganon pa rin yung magiging,

3086
03:29:02,680 --> 03:29:10,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: income or share ng UHC sa kikitain ng, ah, sa manggagaling po sa privatization?

3087
03:29:10,279 --> 03:29:17,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Opo, ah, kami po ay, ah, gumawa na rin ng aming mga sariling computations.

3088
03:29:17,840 --> 03:29:21,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I think, ah, may, may certain numbers kami.

3089
03:29:21,960 --> 03:29:25,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero this we can share with the committee.

3090
03:29:25,279 --> 03:29:27,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Maybe the committee can share with you.

3091
03:29:27,920 --> 03:29:31,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But, ah, we will forward what we have done internally.

3092
03:29:31,960 --> 03:29:45,825
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But making clear that sa ngayon po, yun ni base lamang sa projections namin after the implementation of the decoupling slash privatization.

3093
03:29:45,825 --> 03:29:50,720
Committee/agency brief acknowledgment: Your Honor.

3094
03:29:50,720 --> 03:29:58,640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Madam Chair, Mr. Chairman.

3095
03:29:58,640 --> 03:30:09,279
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kung magkakaroon po tayo ng transitional revenue habang naglilipat ng operations sa private sector, ang PAGCOR,

3096
03:30:09,279 --> 03:30:17,520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ang one-time windfall mula sa privatization ay dapat magsilbing safety cushion para sa UHC.

3097
03:30:17,520 --> 03:30:24,720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Since PAGCOR estimates P30 to P50 billion in proceeds from the sale of casino Filipino assets and licenses,

3098
03:30:24,720 --> 03:30:30,840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: direct UHC collections might experience transition friction.

3099
03:30:30,840 --> 03:30:39,880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, is the Executive willing to commit or does Congress need to legislate a sort of transitional healthcare stabilization fund

3100
03:30:39,880 --> 03:30:46,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sourced directly from the privatization proceeds to guarantee that PhilHealth's annual subsidy is protected?

3101
03:30:46,640 --> 03:30:50,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Para captured pa rin po yung windfall?

3102
03:30:50,800 --> 03:30:54,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, we can look into that.

3103
03:30:54,319 --> 03:31:02,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: As I said earlier in another question, the priority use of the proceeds of the retirement,

3104
03:31:02,080 --> 03:31:09,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: which is now being trimmed down to about 30 on the high side because of the decline,

3105
03:31:09,760 --> 03:31:16,160
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: our priority is being able to pay the retirement of our employees because that, for me,

3106
03:31:16,160 --> 03:31:22,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: is a commitment to protect the interests of our PAGCOR employees.

3107
03:31:22,720 --> 03:31:32,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, coming from kung magkakaroon po ng difference doon sa proceeds and yung binayad natin sa retirement,

3108
03:31:32,479 --> 03:31:44,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: then I think that can be considered as a possibility na magkaroon ng cushion fund, as you had mentioned earlier.

3109
03:31:44,120 --> 03:31:46,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But I wish to state...

3110
03:31:46,359 --> 03:31:58,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: that from my standpoint, the priority also for me is being able to pay the retirement benefits

3111
03:31:58,560 --> 03:32:09,880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and the special incentive package of those who will be affected by this move to decouple PAGCOR.

3112
03:32:09,880 --> 03:32:14,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Magkano po ba yung ano? How much will we spend?

3113
03:32:14,439 --> 03:32:16,319
Committee/agency brief acknowledgment: To ano?

3114
03:32:16,319 --> 03:32:16,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Retirement.

3115
03:32:16,840 --> 03:32:18,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, you're talking for retirement.

3116
03:32:18,880 --> 03:32:19,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes.

3117
03:32:19,319 --> 03:32:36,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We're looking at about 28 to 30 billion as the money needed for the retirement.

3118
03:32:36,840 --> 03:32:42,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Today, we have close to about 12 billion.

3119
03:32:42,279 --> 03:32:45,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, we will be subsidizing coming from the sale.

3120
03:32:45,600 --> 03:32:49,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And the difference, as I mentioned, maybe that can be...

3121
03:32:49,640 --> 03:32:52,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Thank you for your comments.

3122
03:32:52,479 --> 03:33:02,600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And we can study whether that difference can be used as a stabilization fund for the universal healthcare.

3123
03:33:02,600 --> 03:33:08,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: How much, Madam Chair, is the expected windfall?

3124
03:33:08,279 --> 03:33:10,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: You're talking from where, Your Honor?

3125
03:33:10,680 --> 03:33:12,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: From the privatization of...

3126
03:33:12,520 --> 03:33:19,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We're looking at about mga 25 to 30 billion po sa pangkasalukuyan.

3127
03:33:19,840 --> 03:33:21,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And as I said...

3128
03:33:21,080 --> 03:33:27,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: As I said, we have a current retirement fund of about 12 billion.

3129
03:33:27,720 --> 03:33:33,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, magkakaroon po ng positive later on, I'm sure, kahit papano.

3130
03:33:33,239 --> 03:33:35,760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Because existing...

3131
03:33:35,760 --> 03:33:42,439
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Currently po, ang retirement fund ay nagkakahalaga ng mga 12 billion pesos cash in bank na po yun.

3132
03:33:42,439 --> 03:33:51,399
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But after all the expenses, all the retirement benefits and whatever you need to pay,

3133
03:33:51,399 --> 03:33:57,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: upon completion of the privatization, saan po initially dapat ilalagay yung windfall?

3134
03:33:57,600 --> 03:33:58,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Normally po yun.

3135
03:33:58,920 --> 03:34:00,160
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Iri-remit?

3136
03:34:00,160 --> 03:34:03,359
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That becomes extraordinary income.

3137
03:34:03,359 --> 03:34:11,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And that being so, we will be remitting 50% of that later on to the National Treasury.

3138
03:34:11,960 --> 03:34:15,601
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sana nga po, doon na lang sa kusyon ilagay and i-prioritize natin.

3139
03:34:15,601 --> 03:34:16,640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Well, I think, again...

3140
03:34:16,640 --> 03:34:19,030
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So that the UHC is prioritized, hindi po maapektuhan.

3141
03:34:20,160 --> 03:34:26,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I'd like to thank you for your suggestion so that we can look into the matter, Your Honor.

3142
03:34:26,800 --> 03:34:27,760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

3143
03:34:27,760 --> 03:34:29,439
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you to the PAGCOR family.

3144
03:34:29,439 --> 03:34:34,359
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And please expect your request to be delivered within 48 hours.

3145
03:34:34,359 --> 03:34:36,920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, sir.

3146
03:34:36,920 --> 03:34:39,279
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

3147
03:34:39,279 --> 03:34:41,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Representative Nazal.

3148
03:34:41,800 --> 03:34:49,479
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As committed by Chair Al, like all the documentary requirements would be provided within 48 hours after the hearing.

3149
03:34:49,479 --> 03:34:50,601
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We will do.

3150
03:34:50,601 --> 03:34:53,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We will do that, Chairperson.

3151
03:34:53,120 --> 03:34:54,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Chairman Albeca.

3152
03:34:54,520 --> 03:34:55,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Chairman Al.

3153
03:34:55,800 --> 03:34:59,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, thank you, Representative Robert Nazal.

3154
03:34:59,160 --> 03:35:11,239
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We now move to our next interpellator, Representative Julienne “Jam” Baronda, also from the majority.

3155
03:35:11,239 --> 03:35:14,479
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you, Madam Chair.

3156
03:35:14,479 --> 03:35:23,120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: This is more or less commendation of your accomplished, many things that you have accomplished.

3157
03:35:23,120 --> 03:35:31,319
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Indeed, the men and women headed by, of course, our Chairman Tengco of PAGCOR.

3158
03:35:31,319 --> 03:35:45,800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's not only good in managing PAGCOR, but at the same time, you're a good dancer, a good singer, sir, right?

3159
03:35:45,800 --> 03:35:50,479
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, but I would like to commend all of you for a job well done.

3160
03:35:50,479 --> 03:35:55,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Despite and in spite the challenges you've been facing.

3161
03:35:55,160 --> 03:36:07,000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And especially with the recent decision of the Supreme Court, this would probably take more than almost 2 billion a year.

3162
03:36:07,000 --> 03:36:14,000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 3 billion a year, including your arrears for your almost 33 years.

3163
03:36:14,000 --> 03:36:16,000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Diba?

3164
03:36:16,000 --> 03:36:26,040
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, but with your initiative in partnering with the ICT, I believe you'd be able to.

3165
03:36:26,040 --> 03:36:28,600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Somehow, manage the losses.

3166
03:36:28,600 --> 03:36:40,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Now, my only concern is, this is about the implementation of universal healthcare, which you've answered earlier.

3167
03:36:40,520 --> 03:36:53,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I would just like to ask if you have this, like, 5-year contingency plan, how you'd be able to still support universal healthcare,

3168
03:36:53,640 --> 03:36:57,600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: despite this.

3169
03:36:57,600 --> 03:37:03,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: This recent decision of Supreme Court.

3170
03:37:03,640 --> 03:37:23,122
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, first of all, salamat po sa recognition ninyo na ang PAGCOR po ay nakatutulong sa buong bansa at sa ating mga kababayan, despite all the challenges.

3171
03:37:23,122 --> 03:37:23,874
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes.

3172
03:37:23,874 --> 03:37:24,465
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah.

3173
03:37:24,465 --> 03:37:27,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Commitment po namin yan.

3174
03:37:27,000 --> 03:37:41,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At sa abot na aming makakaya, we will continue to reach out to as many Filipinos as we can in the next few years that I am chairman and CEO of PAGCOR.

3175
03:37:41,560 --> 03:37:56,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: To answer your question, Your Honor, Congresswoman Jam, ang nakikita ko pong maliwanag na magaganap ay,

3176
03:37:56,040 --> 03:38:07,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung talaga pong natuloy ang decoupling slash privatization, malaki po ang magiging menos sa gastos ng PAGCOR.

3177
03:38:07,760 --> 03:38:17,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi man po ganung kalaki ang magiging revenue kung sakali magtuloy-tuloy itong challenges na mga kinaharap natin sa pangkasalukuyan.

3178
03:38:17,600 --> 03:38:24,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Iisa pong maliwanag, liliit po ng malaki ang gastos.

3179
03:38:24,080 --> 03:38:24,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 5 billion.

3180
03:38:24,600 --> 03:38:33,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa personal lamang, at sa upa lamang, at sa pagbayad lamang ng utilities,

3181
03:38:33,080 --> 03:38:39,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay in-estimate po namin yan mga 15 billion piso sa isang daon.

3182
03:38:39,520 --> 03:38:47,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ibig sabihin po niyan, yung bottom figure ng PAGCOR ay mananatiling matatag,

3183
03:38:47,439 --> 03:38:50,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: mananatiling maayos.

3184
03:38:50,319 --> 03:38:54,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And dahilan sa automatic na ang batas naman,

3185
03:38:54,520 --> 03:39:03,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay nakasaad doon, 50% ng kita ng PAGCOR ay pupunta sa national government.

3186
03:39:03,479 --> 03:39:09,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa paniniwala ko po, pag na-stabilize na po ang lahat ng ito,

3187
03:39:09,520 --> 03:39:15,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: tulad naman ng anong uri ng pagbabago, may tinatawag na period of adjustment.

3188
03:39:15,600 --> 03:39:20,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero pag naalpasa na po natin itong period of adjustment na ito,

3189
03:39:20,439 --> 03:39:26,151
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: natitiya ko po sa inyo, your honor,

3190
03:39:26,151 --> 03:39:26,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: natitiya.

3191
03:39:26,880 --> 03:39:35,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At natitiya ko po sa inyo na magiging matatag po lalo ang financial health ng PAGCOR.

3192
03:39:35,479 --> 03:39:48,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And that means, protektado po yung nakasaad sa batas na magsishare po tayo sa Universal Healthcare Fund.

3193
03:39:48,160 --> 03:39:53,239
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: With that, Madam Chair, I believe with the good leadership of Chairman Al,

3194
03:39:53,239 --> 03:39:57,239
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we'd be able to deliver what is expected from you.

3195
03:39:57,239 --> 03:40:07,239
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I would just like to commend especially your program with Integrated Resorts Foundation in Clark.

3196
03:40:07,239 --> 03:40:08,479
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes.

3197
03:40:08,479 --> 03:40:16,439
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: In Western Visayas, Region 6, in Western Visayas Medical Center, it is our specialty hospital.

3198
03:40:16,439 --> 03:40:24,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And alongside with Center JV, we expanded the hospital bed capacity from 420 to 700.

3199
03:40:24,640 --> 03:40:26,880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So if you've mentioned that POG,

3200
03:40:26,880 --> 03:40:36,920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we're supported with your partnership with the SED Foundation in construction of the Children's Hospital.

3201
03:40:36,920 --> 03:40:45,840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Now we are in need of the equipping of our cancer center at Western Visayas Medical Center.

3202
03:40:45,840 --> 03:40:56,673
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: If you would also consider helping us, LIAs us, with the Integrated Resorts Foundation.

3203
03:40:59,199 --> 03:41:01,607
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your honor, Congressman Jam.

3204
03:41:01,607 --> 03:41:12,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa harapan pong to, kinukumit ko po, kami ay susuporta at magdudonate ng medical equipment dun sa expanded hospital ninyo.

3205
03:41:12,960 --> 03:41:18,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tulad ng ginawa namin dito sa specialty hospital sa Central Luzon,

3206
03:41:18,359 --> 03:41:25,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I don't think problema naman na hanggang Western Visayas ay makatulong din kami.

3207
03:41:25,520 --> 03:41:26,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, mangyari...

3208
03:41:26,800 --> 03:41:49,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nangyari pong umupo tayo at nang sa ganun mapag-usapan natin sa tulong ni dating Congresswoman Nialla Aguinaldo kung paano kami makakatulong dito sa expanded medical specialty hospital ninyo sa Western Visayas.

3209
03:41:49,279 --> 03:41:50,560
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Umasa po kayo ron?

3210
03:41:50,560 --> 03:41:56,279
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Chair, actually parang nabuhayan ako nung nakita ko si former Congresswoman Nialla Aguinaldo.

3211
03:41:56,279 --> 03:42:02,399
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I hope she can be of help to us, hindi lang sa akin but buong Pilipinas.

3212
03:42:02,399 --> 03:42:18,040
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Actually po, with the recent shooting in Zamboanga, and one of the persons, one of the person involved is may problema.

3213
03:42:18,040 --> 03:42:19,000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Diba, may problema.

3214
03:42:19,000 --> 03:42:22,840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So he needs special care.

3215
03:42:22,840 --> 03:42:28,960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So sa DepEd, especially sa mga spread.

3216
03:42:28,960 --> 03:42:38,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: At ISEC na schools, wala po tayong massive support for children with special needs.

3217
03:42:38,520 --> 03:42:53,399
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Baka pwede nyo po makonsider kasi really need your support, especially by providing equipment in their respective schools at the same time building.

3218
03:42:53,399 --> 03:42:57,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kasi iba ang requirement ng children.

3219
03:42:57,920 --> 03:42:59,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: With special needs.

3220
03:42:59,520 --> 03:43:05,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Baka makonsider nyo ito, Mr. Chair.

3221
03:43:05,560 --> 03:43:08,159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Again, it's a laudable project.

3222
03:43:08,159 --> 03:43:16,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So definitely, Your Honor, Congresswoman Jam, we will be considering this.

3223
03:43:16,560 --> 03:43:25,600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And may I suggest that it form part of the agenda in our meeting with former Congresswoman Nialla Aguinaldo.

3224
03:43:25,600 --> 03:43:26,159
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you po.

3225
03:43:26,159 --> 03:43:29,840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I will coordinate with Secretary Angara.

3226
03:43:29,840 --> 03:43:43,120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: For him to provide list of the regions that needed special care and attention when it comes to your support for children with special needs.

3227
03:43:43,120 --> 03:43:51,479
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Lastly po, please know that I would always be very supportive of the programming endeavor of PAGCOR.

3228
03:43:51,479 --> 03:43:59,399
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And I would like also to commend PAGCOR for having this PAGCOR Dakila Awards for...

3229
03:43:59,399 --> 03:44:02,040
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Women in every Women's Month.

3230
03:44:02,040 --> 03:44:10,960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And last year, you've awarded several women in power because of their services.

3231
03:44:10,960 --> 03:44:30,439
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang tanong ko lang po, kung ano ang mga requirements, ano po yung mga indicators for us to give awards for different...

3232
03:44:30,439 --> 03:44:39,159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Public servants, not only the local, but also in the national level.

3233
03:44:39,159 --> 03:44:47,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Opo, ma'am, actually it's a program extended or implemented because of the requirements of the GAD law.

3234
03:44:47,199 --> 03:44:48,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And I'm...

3235
03:44:48,760 --> 03:45:13,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I'll be very honest, I am not privy to the details, but as I had mentioned to you earlier, I will be in discussions with the person in charge and ask her all the questions and maybe I will ask her to get in touch with you so we can clear and clarify everything regarding this project.

3236
03:45:13,760 --> 03:45:31,720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Well, I just wanted to make sure that this program will be long-term in nature. At the same time, can we not only include women in government, but of course, especially for our supporters from private sectors.

3237
03:45:31,720 --> 03:45:44,238
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Again, thank you so much, PAGCOR family. I look forward to working and collaborating with you in providing best healthcare for our Filipino people. God bless.

3238
03:45:44,238 --> 03:46:12,032
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Thank you so much, your honor, for your suggestions. I really like the suggestion on the special children. So, PAGCOR has not yet had any projects. And I think this will be an opportunity for PAGCOR to touch the lives and the families of these special children. So, we will seriously look into this matter.

3239
03:46:12,032 --> 03:46:13,960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much.

3240
03:46:13,960 --> 03:46:42,319
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Because in Iloilo City alone, there are more than 500 children who are being initially diagnosed with special needs. So, in the whole of the Philippines, how many are there? And remember, the person involved in some buwanga is also someone that needs special attention. So, with this, I believe more people will be able to help. Thank you again, Chairman.

3241
03:46:42,319 --> 03:46:45,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Thank you, your honor.

3242
03:46:45,399 --> 03:46:51,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Representative Jam Baronda. Next to interpellate from the minority, Representative Bong Suntay.

3243
03:46:51,920 --> 03:47:23,319
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Thank you very much, Madam Chair.

3244
03:47:23,319 --> 03:47:33,199
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Thank you very much, sir.

3245
03:47:33,199 --> 03:47:44,960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, the earnings of PAGCOR come from casino funds.

3246
03:47:44,960 --> 03:47:54,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Filipino operations, licensed casinos, digital gaming, e-games, and non-gaming income.

3247
03:47:54,120 --> 03:48:01,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Now, when it comes to casino Filipino operations, because the data that I have is past 2024,

3248
03:48:01,319 --> 03:48:08,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: how much is the income of PAGCOR from casino Filipino operations for 2026?

3249
03:48:08,840 --> 03:48:17,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: For 2026, we're projecting gross gaming revenue to be down to about Php 10 billion.

3250
03:48:17,040 --> 03:48:24,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So from Php 12.6 million in 2024, now it's Php 10 billion?

3251
03:48:24,880 --> 03:48:28,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: That's high. I project to hit between Php 9 billion and Php 10 billion only.

3252
03:48:28,880 --> 03:48:32,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, how much is the income of casino Filipino operations?

3253
03:48:32,520 --> 03:48:35,439
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I think it's 38 billion.

3254
03:48:35,439 --> 03:48:36,359
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 38?

3255
03:48:36,359 --> 03:48:36,895
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 38?

3256
03:48:36,895 --> 03:48:41,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Can you get it?

3257
03:48:41,880 --> 03:48:50,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We will be sending also the committee to the casino Filipino list of our casino Filipino properties.

3258
03:48:50,520 --> 03:48:58,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, and with regards to the licensed casino operations, how much was the revenue for 2026?

3259
03:48:58,520 --> 03:49:00,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Projected revenue for 2026?

3260
03:49:00,000 --> 03:49:06,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Projected revenue for 2026 of licensed casinos excluding casino Filipino.

3261
03:49:06,800 --> 03:49:08,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: No, the licensed one.

3262
03:49:08,520 --> 03:49:11,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: It's the private one.

3263
03:49:11,080 --> 03:49:15,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We're looking at about Php 31, Php 31.5 billion.

3264
03:49:15,640 --> 03:49:19,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Php 31.5. So it's also down from Php 33 in 2024.

3265
03:49:19,880 --> 03:49:22,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, sir. Yes, Your Honor. Sorry.

3266
03:49:22,520 --> 03:49:31,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Now, for digital, can I also have a list of our private casinos and the respective revenues coming from each?

3267
03:49:31,239 --> 03:49:34,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, what Your Honor, we can do is send the committee.

3268
03:49:34,640 --> 03:49:46,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We can send the committee a complete list in detail of our revenue coming from licensed casinos, from casino Filipino, and from online gaming.

3269
03:49:46,880 --> 03:49:47,359
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay.

3270
03:49:47,359 --> 03:49:52,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: These are the three major revenue drivers of PAGCOR today, Your Honor.

3271
03:49:52,760 --> 03:49:59,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. Now, for digital e-games, how much is the projected revenue for 2026?

3272
03:49:59,800 --> 03:50:04,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The projected revenue for 2026 is Php 38 billion.

3273
03:50:04,880 --> 03:50:06,960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Php 38 to 40 billion.

3274
03:50:06,960 --> 03:50:08,279
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Php 38 to 40 billion.

3275
03:50:08,279 --> 03:50:15,132
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But the highest revenue generator would now be digital e-games.

3276
03:50:15,132 --> 03:50:27,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Although as I have already mentioned earlier, now the trend is that licensed casinos are gradually surpassing online gaming.

3277
03:50:27,080 --> 03:50:42,439
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, regarding this development, do you consider this a positive development or a source of concern na yung revenue ng PAGCOR comes heavily from e-games or online gaming?

3278
03:50:42,439 --> 03:50:49,399
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Actually, sa amin pong pag-aaral, it is both plus and minus.

3279
03:50:49,399 --> 03:51:10,803
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Plus in the sense na kung wala po ito, lalong hirap na hirap na ang PAGCOR sa pangkasalukuyan dahil pataas po yung gastos at napakalaki ng sweldo ng mga empleyado. So kung hindi po dumating yung online gaming, malaki na po ang problema ng PAGCOR sa pangkasalukuyan.

3280
03:51:10,803 --> 03:51:17,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: If online gaming does not come, the problem of PAGCOR in the present is already big.

3281
03:51:17,520 --> 03:51:37,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But a minus because I'm concerned that the big licensees are also seeing a decline in revenue.

3282
03:51:37,720 --> 03:51:41,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: It's just one full circle.

3283
03:51:41,680 --> 03:51:45,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: There's a time when it's really low, there's a time when it's going to rise again.

3284
03:51:45,760 --> 03:51:57,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Like what we all saw, when we had a problem with COVID, when we had the pandemic,

3285
03:51:57,319 --> 03:52:00,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: the income of licensed casinos really increased.

3286
03:52:00,120 --> 03:52:06,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But when it recovered, it rebelled.

3287
03:52:06,439 --> 03:52:12,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: The revenue of this really increased.

3288
03:52:12,239 --> 03:52:15,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Now, because of all these problems we are encountering,

3289
03:52:15,479 --> 03:52:22,228
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: the Middle East crisis, the economic backlash in the world,

3290
03:52:22,228 --> 03:52:31,088
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: it looks like the revenue of licensed casinos is going to drop.

3291
03:52:31,088 --> 03:52:35,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But like the historical data I'm reading,

3292
03:52:35,640 --> 03:52:39,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: all the 40, almost 45 years of PAGCOR,

3293
03:52:39,920 --> 03:52:43,861
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: its revenue really has a cycle.

3294
03:52:43,861 --> 03:52:51,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: However, we can't really avoid not accepting online gaming

3295
03:52:51,520 --> 03:52:55,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: because digital advances in technology are already dictating.

3296
03:52:55,800 --> 03:53:01,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Plus, the whole world, including the United Arab Emirates,

3297
03:53:01,040 --> 03:53:05,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: can you imagine, will already be given a license by 2027.

3298
03:53:05,439 --> 03:53:07,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: For online gaming.

3299
03:53:07,600 --> 03:53:15,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: The countries in Europe, there are already a lot of people announcing that they will also be given a license for online gaming.

3300
03:53:15,520 --> 03:53:21,759
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, if we don't worry about this and just let it go,

3301
03:53:21,759 --> 03:53:26,447
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: there's a lot of loss in our revenue for our government.

3302
03:53:26,447 --> 03:53:27,856
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Your Honor.

3303
03:53:27,856 --> 03:53:29,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I have a question.

3304
03:53:29,120 --> 03:53:32,159
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because while the concern of others,

3305
03:53:32,159 --> 03:53:35,327
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: while their concern is the dwindling revenue,

3306
03:53:35,327 --> 03:53:37,319
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the dwindling revenue of PAGCOR,

3307
03:53:37,319 --> 03:53:39,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: my concern is different.

3308
03:53:39,560 --> 03:53:44,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Where will the revenue of PAGCOR come from?

3309
03:53:44,040 --> 03:53:48,239
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because, as you mentioned earlier,

3310
03:53:48,239 --> 03:53:50,013
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: online gaming is increasing.

3311
03:53:50,013 --> 03:53:53,039
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: You also mentioned earlier, Chairman Al,

3312
03:53:53,039 --> 03:53:58,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: that usually, the one who plays online games comes from CDE.

3313
03:53:58,600 --> 03:54:02,399
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, it means, that's where the money will come from.

3314
03:54:02,399 --> 03:54:06,279
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And then we are spending, well, you are giving,

3315
03:54:06,279 --> 03:54:07,279
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: what?

3316
03:54:07,279 --> 03:54:16,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: How much did you give for the share for the social programs of the President?

3317
03:54:16,120 --> 03:54:21,960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And also, the one you are using for social outreach?

3318
03:54:21,960 --> 03:54:23,680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: How many percent?

3319
03:54:23,680 --> 03:54:25,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: How many billion?

3320
03:54:25,920 --> 03:54:29,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: A billion for social outreach.

3321
03:54:29,439 --> 03:54:35,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Maybe in one year, there will be a decrease of about 15 million.

3322
03:54:35,080 --> 03:54:36,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 15 to 18 billion.

3323
03:54:36,680 --> 03:54:38,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: 15 to 18 billion.

3324
03:54:38,760 --> 03:54:44,927
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, isn't it ironic that the one who is in charge of online gaming

3325
03:54:44,927 --> 03:54:47,736
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: is getting money from CDE,

3326
03:54:47,736 --> 03:54:53,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: and then we will release money for social projects

3327
03:54:53,080 --> 03:54:55,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: in the amount of about 18 billion,

3328
03:54:55,760 --> 03:55:00,093
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: not to mention the President's Social Fund also,

3329
03:55:00,093 --> 03:55:02,199
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: which is also being used there,

3330
03:55:02,199 --> 03:55:04,055
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: also to help the CDE.

3331
03:55:04,055 --> 03:55:08,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The people who are also getting money,

3332
03:55:08,520 --> 03:55:09,540
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the same class of people,

3333
03:55:09,540 --> 03:55:12,439
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: where the money is also coming from.

3334
03:55:12,439 --> 03:55:15,840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That's why, that's the cause of my concern.

3335
03:55:15,840 --> 03:55:24,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because fundamentally, the architectural framework of online gaming is different.

3336
03:55:24,800 --> 03:55:31,199
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Unlike physical casinos, there are also physical barriers.

3337
03:55:31,199 --> 03:55:33,079
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Before you can enter,

3338
03:55:33,079 --> 03:55:38,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: you will see if you are young, if you are poor, if you have money,

3339
03:55:38,920 --> 03:55:42,199
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: unlike online gaming.

3340
03:55:42,199 --> 03:55:46,894
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, this was the same question that I asked PAGCOR during the 18th Congress,

3341
03:55:46,894 --> 03:55:49,439
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: when they allowed E-Sabong.

3342
03:55:49,439 --> 03:55:51,199
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I could not understand why,

3343
03:55:51,199 --> 03:55:55,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: during the time when the economy was closed,

3344
03:55:55,640 --> 03:55:57,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: there was a lockdown,

3345
03:55:57,260 --> 03:56:01,479
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the Filipinos were unable to work,

3346
03:56:01,479 --> 03:56:03,721
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the government allowed the program,

3347
03:56:03,721 --> 03:56:09,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the government allowed the proliferation of E-Sabong.

3348
03:56:09,080 --> 03:56:14,239
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The security guards, the children, the people without money.

3349
03:56:14,239 --> 03:56:23,319
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, isn't it important that before we open or expand online gaming,

3350
03:56:23,319 --> 03:56:27,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: we have to strengthen first our regulatory powers

3351
03:56:27,840 --> 03:56:30,653
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: on how to police

3352
03:56:30,653 --> 03:56:36,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: those who are playing games?

3353
03:56:36,399 --> 03:56:39,159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, I totally agree with you,

3354
03:56:39,159 --> 03:56:41,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: with your comments.

3355
03:56:41,720 --> 03:56:45,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But unfortunately,

3356
03:56:45,000 --> 03:56:48,346
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: advances in technology are too fast

3357
03:56:48,346 --> 03:56:50,657
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: that we cannot not follow suit.

3358
03:56:50,657 --> 03:56:53,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Because what will happen, Your Honor,

3359
03:56:53,439 --> 03:56:57,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: if we don't follow suit,

3360
03:56:57,439 --> 03:57:00,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: it will be illegal for the technology to flourish.

3361
03:57:00,080 --> 03:57:03,917
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Because the illegals are the ones who are saddened.

3362
03:57:03,917 --> 03:57:05,305
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: There are no illegals here in the Philippines.

3363
03:57:05,305 --> 03:57:07,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We are being targeted outside.

3364
03:57:07,840 --> 03:57:15,114
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, I understand what you are saying.

3365
03:57:15,114 --> 03:57:20,991
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But we cannot continue to fight for the present.

3366
03:57:20,991 --> 03:57:24,157
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Because we will eat the illegals.

3367
03:57:24,157 --> 03:57:25,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: The illegals are continuing.

3368
03:57:25,600 --> 03:57:33,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: That's why Congressman Ryan mentioned earlier that the place we closed that he requested is now open again.

3369
03:57:33,399 --> 03:57:42,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, no matter how hard it is, we need to look at what you are saying.

3370
03:57:42,040 --> 03:57:50,254
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At the same time, we need to do the same with our online gaming.

3371
03:57:50,254 --> 03:57:54,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Because if not, we will eat our lives.

3372
03:57:54,760 --> 03:57:59,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, I totally agree with you, Your Honor.

3373
03:57:59,520 --> 03:58:01,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We are doing whatever we can.

3374
03:58:01,840 --> 03:58:10,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We are strengthening our structures and our online gaming guidelines, rules and regulations.

3375
03:58:10,479 --> 03:58:16,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We are updating it on a regular basis based on market trends.

3376
03:58:16,680 --> 03:58:22,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But unfortunately, we also have to...

3377
03:58:22,680 --> 03:58:28,338
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: go head-to-head with the online gaming industry.

3378
03:58:28,338 --> 03:58:36,321
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because if we do not follow this, we will not be able to catch up with the illegal operators

3379
03:58:36,321 --> 03:58:41,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: who are constantly harassing our fellow citizens.

3380
03:58:41,600 --> 03:58:42,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yes, Chairman Alf.

3381
03:58:42,640 --> 03:58:44,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I totally agree with you.

3382
03:58:44,080 --> 03:58:46,439
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, I'm not against online gaming.

3383
03:58:46,439 --> 03:58:48,279
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What I'm saying is...

3384
03:58:48,279 --> 03:58:51,399
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What I'm against is...

3385
03:58:51,399 --> 03:59:00,479
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: How can we properly police the people who play online games?

3386
03:59:00,479 --> 03:59:02,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: How do we police them?

3387
03:59:02,520 --> 03:59:06,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Whether they're minors, whether they come from the...

3388
03:59:06,080 --> 03:59:07,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That's what you're saying.

3389
03:59:07,720 --> 03:59:10,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We know that it comes from CDE.

3390
03:59:10,560 --> 03:59:15,373
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And to allow them to continue to gamble...

3391
03:59:15,373 --> 03:59:17,973
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There's always a complaint.

3392
03:59:17,973 --> 03:59:19,487
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There's a shortage of medicine to buy.

3393
03:59:19,487 --> 03:59:21,227
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There's a shortage of food to buy.

3394
03:59:21,227 --> 03:59:23,160
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There's a shortage of electricity to pay.

3395
03:59:23,160 --> 03:59:25,960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There's a shortage of education for the children.

3396
03:59:25,960 --> 03:59:32,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But usually, as your data would show...

3397
03:59:32,600 --> 03:59:37,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: They are usually the customers of online gaming sites.

3398
03:59:37,880 --> 03:59:40,840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And I think...

3399
03:59:40,840 --> 03:59:45,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We have to concentrate first on how to properly police these people.

3400
03:59:45,720 --> 03:59:47,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Otherwise...

3401
03:59:47,120 --> 03:59:51,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kawawa naman yung walang mangyayari sa bansa natin.

3402
03:59:51,760 --> 03:59:58,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, the reason why, for example, in China, why they have restricted gambling,

3403
03:59:58,560 --> 04:00:11,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: kasi ayaw nilang nagsusugal yung mga insek, masusto nilang magtrabaho yung mga kanilang mga citizens.

3404
04:00:11,600 --> 04:00:19,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And dito sa atin nga, what are the concrete steps that we have tried to take?

3405
04:00:19,600 --> 04:00:29,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I understand that technology is evolving very fast, but we're not doing anything.

3406
04:00:29,120 --> 04:00:40,399
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Walang pinagkaiba yan. Naalala ko nung tinesting ng gobyerno yung online na motorcycle na sinabi nila,

3407
04:00:40,399 --> 04:00:41,439
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: hindi, kayaan muna.

3408
04:00:41,439 --> 04:00:45,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kayaan natin sila mag-operate without having a regulatory framework.

3409
04:00:45,960 --> 04:00:51,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: By the time na ang dami nang nandun sa platform, hindi na nila kayang i-regulate.

3410
04:00:51,800 --> 04:00:57,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Baka ganyan din yung mangyayari sa atin.

3411
04:00:57,920 --> 04:01:08,199
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I can only answer that I guess we just have to look into it and see how we can strengthen the structures at the same time.

3412
04:01:08,199 --> 04:01:14,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, yun lang Madam Chair. I hope we really look into it and come up with ways to,

3413
04:01:14,120 --> 04:01:23,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: to properly regulate it bago, bago ano, bago dumating sa size na hindi na natin kayang kontrolin talaga.

3414
04:01:23,760 --> 04:01:25,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Chair.

3415
04:01:25,680 --> 04:01:26,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you.

3416
04:01:26,840 --> 04:01:29,399
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Representative Bong Sunday.

3417
04:01:29,399 --> 04:01:34,239
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Our next interpellator, Representative Mica Gonzales.

3418
04:01:34,239 --> 04:01:36,399
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Madam Chair.

3419
04:01:36,399 --> 04:01:43,359
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So I think, Chairman Al, I think you feel the sentiment of our colleagues is to protect

3420
04:01:43,359 --> 04:01:47,560
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: the Filipino people from excessive gambling, di ba po?

3421
04:01:47,560 --> 04:01:56,399
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So in relating to that, I would like to ask, kasi ba, from the previous committee hearings of the Ames and Amusement here in the House,

3422
04:01:56,399 --> 04:02:02,760
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: I asked regarding setting a cap or setting a limit per user.

3423
04:02:02,760 --> 04:02:09,640
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: For example, meron tayong online gaming and meron tayong user na player.

3424
04:02:09,640 --> 04:02:13,159
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: I asked them previously kung sino ba nasa set.

3425
04:02:13,159 --> 04:02:20,880
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Nang cap or nang maximum bet nila per day or I don't know how we should call it, no?

3426
04:02:20,880 --> 04:02:25,600
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Wala pala tayong sineset na cap per player.

3427
04:02:25,600 --> 04:02:37,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So I would like to ask if up until now po, wala pa rin po ba kayong sineset na cap or limit per player in a day or in a week?

3428
04:02:37,439 --> 04:02:39,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa ngayon po, wala.

3429
04:02:39,920 --> 04:02:42,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I'd be very candid and honest about it.

3430
04:02:42,800 --> 04:02:55,120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, we have not set, but I believe in the online gaming law that is being proposed,

3431
04:02:55,120 --> 04:03:04,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: there will be an inclusion of these caps, whether caps on deposits and caps of gaming activity.

3432
04:03:04,640 --> 04:03:06,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, because...

3433
04:03:06,080 --> 04:03:13,359
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Yun po ang, Your Honor, yun po ang gustong patunguan.

3434
04:03:13,359 --> 04:03:19,880
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Nang parehong committee sa Senado, gayon din sa Kongreso, para po ma-address yung binabanggit ninyo.

3435
04:03:19,880 --> 04:03:22,120
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Your Honor.

3436
04:03:22,120 --> 04:03:23,479
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Madam Chair.

3437
04:03:23,479 --> 04:03:26,479
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Next question po.

3438
04:03:26,479 --> 04:03:36,239
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Since it was also opened na yung online gaming is mas madali, is more accessible compared to, you know, going to a casino, you know, playing there.

3439
04:03:36,239 --> 04:03:43,120
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: And we all know that government employees are not allowed to play sa casino.

3440
04:03:43,120 --> 04:03:52,319
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: And do we have, sa online gaming po ba, how can they detect na, oh, ito, ano to, polis to, oh, ito, they work for the government.

3441
04:03:52,319 --> 04:04:03,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Mayroon po ba tayong mechanism to ensure that government employees will not and are not allowed to play, even if it's online gaming?

3442
04:04:03,080 --> 04:04:11,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, definitely, we are strictly implementing the KYC process,

3443
04:04:11,880 --> 04:04:14,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: meaning, know your customer.

3444
04:04:14,640 --> 04:04:23,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Lahat po ng licenses ay dapat suriin ng mabuti yung mga magre-rehistro sa kanila.

3445
04:04:23,720 --> 04:04:32,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At kung dumating po yung pagkakataon na nakalusot sila, yung secondary screening po naman na ginagawa ng PAGCOR,

3446
04:04:32,239 --> 04:04:40,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and we have been very successful, Your Honor, ay yung pagvo-void ng kanilang panalo.

3447
04:04:40,640 --> 04:04:42,178
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, kung sa kanilang...

3448
04:04:42,178 --> 04:04:52,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung sa kanilang may nakalusot na isang government employee na nakapaglaro at sila'y swinerte at nanalo,

3449
04:04:52,000 --> 04:04:56,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bago po nila ma-withdraw yun, marami din pong screening yun.

3450
04:04:56,600 --> 04:05:08,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, pag na-discovery po na sila'y empleyado ng gobyerno, whether siya po'y isang opisyal o isang karaniwang empleyado lamang,

3451
04:05:08,359 --> 04:05:11,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: we void the winnings.

3452
04:05:11,359 --> 04:05:20,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And I can say, I can tell you and members of the committee that in the last two years,

3453
04:05:20,479 --> 04:05:28,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: we have voided close to half a billion pesos worth of winnings already sapagkat na-discovery po namin

3454
04:05:28,439 --> 04:05:35,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na ang mga nanalong ito ay mga empleyado o kawani ng ating pamahalaan.

3455
04:05:35,520 --> 04:05:40,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yun po yung secondary screening process.

3456
04:05:40,560 --> 04:05:46,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Natupad po namin nitong panunungkulan ko bilang Pagcourt Chairman and CEO.

3457
04:05:46,399 --> 04:05:56,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero ang mahalaga po at ang unang hakbang ay sa registration pa lamang, yung pong tinataw na KYC.

3458
04:05:56,239 --> 04:06:01,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Unfortunately, Your Honor, meron pa pong nakalulusot doon.

3459
04:06:01,399 --> 04:06:08,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nagsusumiti ng fake na ID halimbawa or hindi dinidisclose na sila'y kawani ng pamahalaan,

3460
04:06:08,560 --> 04:06:10,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: eh meron.

3461
04:06:10,080 --> 04:06:11,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron pa rin pong gano'n.

3462
04:06:11,560 --> 04:06:19,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At sabi ko nga, doon pong pagsala roon, eh yun ang pag mag-reclaim na sila ng premyo,

3463
04:06:19,760 --> 04:06:27,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: doon naman papasok yung paghihingi muli ng final submission mo ng ID.

3464
04:06:27,840 --> 04:06:34,840
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: At doon nga po, matagumpay namin masasabi na naging maganda yung programa

3465
04:06:34,840 --> 04:06:39,640
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: dahil sa marami na po kaming vinoid na winnings.

3466
04:06:39,640 --> 04:06:40,359
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Yun lang.

3467
04:06:40,359 --> 04:06:41,359
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Your Honor.

3468
04:06:41,359 --> 04:06:44,239
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Madam Chair Chairman Al.

3469
04:06:44,239 --> 04:06:54,439
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: That is for the kasino po na pwedeng puntahan but I would also like to ask if meron na po ba tayong sort of security mechanism sa online gaming?

3470
04:06:54,439 --> 04:06:57,720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Like yung mga, alam mo yung sa Facebook, yung mga ads.

3471
04:06:57,720 --> 04:07:03,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So do we have some sort of mechanism to ensure that the player is not a government employee?

3472
04:07:03,600 --> 04:07:07,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, that is through the KYC process, ma'am.

3473
04:07:07,000 --> 04:07:08,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ah.

3474
04:07:08,000 --> 04:07:13,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung iba po yung KYC.

3475
04:07:13,640 --> 04:07:25,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang totoo, maski magsubok kayo, hindi kayo makakamagiging member or magiging player ng isang legal license kasino

3476
04:07:25,080 --> 04:07:30,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung ikaw ay government employee dahilan sa KYC.

3477
04:07:30,199 --> 04:07:35,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang malaki pong problema, Your Honor, yung iligal po.

3478
04:07:35,040 --> 04:07:38,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sapagkat sa iligal, wala pong KYC process.

3479
04:07:38,600 --> 04:07:40,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Maging sa edad?

3480
04:07:40,840 --> 04:07:46,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Occupation or identification, yun po ang malaking problema natin.

3481
04:07:46,399 --> 04:07:56,119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya, Your Honor, po ulit-ulit kong sinasabi, ang problema po ng industriyang ito ay yung iligal.

3482
04:07:56,119 --> 04:08:03,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil sa iligal operators, tinatanggap po maski minor de edad, maski teenager.

3483
04:08:03,680 --> 04:08:09,279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Samantalang dito po sa proseso natin sa may lisensya sa online,

3484
04:08:09,279 --> 04:08:22,560
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: halos, sabihin na natin, high 90s in percentage na ang dumataan sa very strict process of KYC.

3485
04:08:22,560 --> 04:08:23,600
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Madam Chair.

3486
04:08:23,600 --> 04:08:26,399
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So, last question na lamang po.

3487
04:08:26,399 --> 04:08:34,199
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Since we have stern warning sa mga kasino operators po,

3488
04:08:34,199 --> 04:08:38,040
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: do we also have sort of mechanism of,

3489
04:08:38,040 --> 04:08:42,960
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: mechanism on players na they could be permanently blocked from a casino?

3490
04:08:42,960 --> 04:08:53,199
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Like for example, I don't know, do we have some sort of instances na we permanently blocked off a player in entering a casino?

3491
04:08:53,199 --> 04:09:05,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, I did report earlier, as of today, we have a list that contains 15,000 names,

3492
04:09:05,199 --> 04:09:10,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung saan, they are not allowed to enter any of the casinos,

3493
04:09:10,600 --> 04:09:15,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nor they are allowed to play in online gaming platforms.

3494
04:09:15,760 --> 04:09:24,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yun po ay na-generate natin sa pamamagitan ng programang self-exclusion at family exclusion.

3495
04:09:24,399 --> 04:09:33,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung saan, ang isang nalululun na sa sugal ay pwedeng sumulat sa akin or sa PAGCOR,

3496
04:09:33,040 --> 04:09:37,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para magsabing ayoko na magsugal, ipaban niyo po ako.

3497
04:09:37,760 --> 04:09:42,159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, that ban is there for years.

3498
04:09:42,159 --> 04:09:44,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi po natin linilift basta-basta yun.

3499
04:09:44,880 --> 04:09:53,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pagdating naman po sa, kung ikaw ay nakalista sa National Database of Restricted Personnel,

3500
04:09:53,319 --> 04:10:00,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yun po ay nakakalat din sa lahat ng kasinos at marami po ang nahuhuli

3501
04:10:00,600 --> 04:10:05,000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na hindi pwedeng makapaglaro.

3502
04:10:05,000 --> 04:10:12,479
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron din po kaming family exclusion program kung saan ang isang asawa or ang kapamilya

3503
04:10:12,479 --> 04:10:21,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay pwedeng mag-request sa PAGCOR na hindi na pwedeng papasukin ang kanyang kamag-anak,

3504
04:10:21,520 --> 04:10:30,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kanyang asawa, ang kanyang ama, ang kanyang anak sa mga casinos at online gaming sites natin.

3505
04:10:30,520 --> 04:10:38,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 15,000 na po ang numero na meron tayo.

3506
04:10:38,520 --> 04:10:45,439
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At nitong nakaraang taon lamang, meron pong halos labing isang libo mahigit

3507
04:10:45,439 --> 04:10:53,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang nag-apply for self-exclusion program ng PAGCOR.

3508
04:10:53,080 --> 04:10:57,040
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Okay, thank you. That will be all. Thank you Chairman Al and thank you Madam Chair.

3509
04:10:57,040 --> 04:10:59,239
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Salamat din po, Your Honor.

3510
04:10:59,239 --> 04:11:03,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Representative Mica Gonzales.

3511
04:11:03,680 --> 04:11:09,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's one more signed up from the minority, Representative Jernie Jett Nisay.

3512
04:11:09,000 --> 04:11:14,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: However, as I'm not seeing Kong Jet here, we'll move to the majority.

3513
04:11:14,680 --> 04:11:18,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Our next interpellator, Representative Shirlyn Bañas-Nograles.

3514
04:11:18,840 --> 04:11:20,800
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Thank you, Madam Chair.

3515
04:11:20,800 --> 04:11:25,520
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Since it's past lunch time already, I'll try to be brief.

3516
04:11:25,520 --> 04:11:27,560
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: I just have two queries.

3517
04:11:27,560 --> 04:11:30,760
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Still on online gambling.

3518
04:11:30,760 --> 04:11:34,720
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Because we've noticed, just a follow-through po sa earlier queries.

3519
04:11:34,720 --> 04:11:42,119
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Since we've noticed that it's becoming prevalent to the detriment of the vulnerable sectors.

3520
04:11:42,119 --> 04:11:52,080
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: So, and given po the easy access to mobile portals via payment gateways,

3521
04:11:52,080 --> 04:12:00,279
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: meron po ba tayong stringent technical protocol imposed on licenses?

3522
04:12:00,279 --> 04:12:07,520
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: To prevent the minors, government employees, and even the low-income earners from gambling.

3523
04:12:07,520 --> 04:12:12,239
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Kasi especially po yung micro-bets, it allows one peso to five pesos.

3524
04:12:12,239 --> 04:12:18,640
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: So, even yung mga four-piece beneficiaries natin, talagang marami na rin po ang nalululong.

3525
04:12:18,640 --> 04:12:22,880
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: At second question ko po, isahin ko na lang para mabilis.

3526
04:12:22,880 --> 04:12:27,800
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: In the report po, your relief operations for calamity victims,

3527
04:12:27,800 --> 04:12:34,040
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: I'm just interested to know how you allocate and operationalize this po.

3528
04:12:34,040 --> 04:12:37,600
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: If I may be allowed, I want to be a bit specific.

3529
04:12:37,600 --> 04:12:42,080
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: In the recent earthquake that happened in General Santos City,

3530
04:12:42,080 --> 04:12:44,960
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: maybe some details just eluded me.

3531
04:12:44,960 --> 04:12:49,840
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Meron po bang assistance extended yung pub core to General Santos City?

3532
04:12:49,840 --> 04:12:56,159
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: And second po, construction of classrooms

3533
04:12:56,159 --> 04:13:03,040
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: is also included among the priority projects of pub core.

3534
04:13:03,040 --> 04:13:10,279
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: In Jansan, we have like 1,400 classrooms that were badly damaged by the 7.8 earthquake.

3535
04:13:10,279 --> 04:13:13,680
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: May we know po if there has been commitment also from pub core,

3536
04:13:13,680 --> 04:13:17,479
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: since it is mentioned among your priority program.

3537
04:13:17,479 --> 04:13:20,640
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Your Honor, ma'am.

3538
04:13:20,640 --> 04:13:22,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: You're asking what's the process?

3539
04:13:22,359 --> 04:13:26,040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: The process is when there's a major calamity,

3540
04:13:26,040 --> 04:13:28,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Doon po muna tayo sa first question.

3541
04:13:28,199 --> 04:13:31,119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Is there a stringent technical protocol?

3542
04:13:31,119 --> 04:13:36,119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: The stringent measure, Your Honor, is the KYC process.

3543
04:13:36,119 --> 04:13:38,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Know your customer process.

3544
04:13:38,800 --> 04:13:42,640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: You cannot register in an online gaming,

3545
04:13:42,640 --> 04:13:45,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I'm sure you're referring to online gaming.

3546
04:13:45,319 --> 04:13:49,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: It will be difficult for you to register in an online gaming app

3547
04:13:49,840 --> 04:13:53,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: to become a regular customer or player

3548
04:13:53,359 --> 04:13:55,960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: if you do not go to a,

3549
04:13:55,960 --> 04:13:57,600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: KYC.

3550
04:13:57,600 --> 04:14:05,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And in that KYC, as I was explaining to Kong Micah earlier,

3551
04:14:05,520 --> 04:14:08,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bago po kayo makapaglaro, dapat makumpleto niyo yun.

3552
04:14:08,920 --> 04:14:14,560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And doon po ay nandun lahat ng datos ninyo.

3553
04:14:14,560 --> 04:14:17,080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Whether you are a government employee,

3554
04:14:17,080 --> 04:14:25,159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: whether, because you will have to present a valid government ID in that process.

3555
04:14:25,159 --> 04:14:25,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So,

3556
04:14:25,800 --> 04:14:27,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: that is being implemented.

3557
04:14:27,800 --> 04:14:30,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang sinasabi ko po earlier,

3558
04:14:30,399 --> 04:14:32,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, ang problema po natin,

3559
04:14:32,920 --> 04:14:35,840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kaya maraming nalululun talaga,

3560
04:14:35,840 --> 04:14:40,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay yung mga illegal operators na walang lisensya sa PAGCOR.

3561
04:14:40,239 --> 04:14:45,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: They compose 50% of the total industry.

3562
04:14:45,880 --> 04:14:47,239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Doon po kasi,

3563
04:14:47,239 --> 04:14:50,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kasi wala ni isang uri ng proseso.

3564
04:14:50,760 --> 04:14:58,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya kabataan ka, kaya mahirap ka, kaya nagtatrabaho ka sa pamahalan, pwede kang maglaro doon.

3565
04:14:58,680 --> 04:15:04,199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yun po ang nakasisira sa lehiti mong mga may lisensya.

3566
04:15:04,199 --> 04:15:08,760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So that is my answer to question number one.

3567
04:15:08,760 --> 04:15:17,399
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: With regard to your question number two, yes, we did support the victims of General Santos

3568
04:15:17,399 --> 04:15:27,159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: by giving financial and relief packages.

3569
04:15:27,159 --> 04:15:31,920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And we coordinated this with the Office of Civil Defense.

3570
04:15:31,920 --> 04:15:37,520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sila po ang katulong namin nag-airlift ng lahat ng support at tulong namin.

3571
04:15:37,520 --> 04:15:38,319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Now,

3572
04:15:38,319 --> 04:15:42,880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: on your question number two,

3573
04:15:42,880 --> 04:15:46,800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: aside from that, you were asking what is the process?

3574
04:15:46,800 --> 04:15:50,680
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Pag may malaki pong kalamigat,

3575
04:15:50,680 --> 04:15:56,239
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: we already voluntarily help.

3576
04:15:56,239 --> 04:15:57,199
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Hindi na po humingi.

3577
04:15:57,199 --> 04:16:03,840
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Pero, kung meron po kayo sa lugar ninyo na malaking disaster, malaking problema,

3578
04:16:03,840 --> 04:16:08,000
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: all you have to do is write me a letter or write PAGCOR a letter.

3579
04:16:08,000 --> 04:16:10,880
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: And wala pong problema yun, we support.

3580
04:16:10,880 --> 04:16:21,920
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: In fact, in the last week and a half, we have sent out more than 100,000 relief packs all over the Philippines.

3581
04:16:21,920 --> 04:16:27,199
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: And some of your colleagues have received also help.

3582
04:16:27,199 --> 04:16:34,640
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: So, all you have to do, ma'am, is just write us and we will respond to the best of our ability.

3583
04:16:34,640 --> 04:16:35,520
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Thank you, sir.

3584
04:16:35,520 --> 04:16:37,840
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Maybe you can help us also with the classroom.

3585
04:16:37,840 --> 04:16:42,800
Rep. Shirlyn L. Bañas-Nograles: Classroom constructions because lots of our classrooms are really badly damaged because of...

3586
04:16:42,800 --> 04:16:48,359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung pulang kasing reconstruction, we are not allowed sa repair.

3587
04:16:48,359 --> 04:16:49,119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Rehabilitation.

3588
04:16:49,119 --> 04:16:49,680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: O, rehabilitation.

3589
